(1906190, 262984, 14212, '<td valign="top">OOOH!  the best so far. A definite winner. 10</td>', 'OOOH!  the best so far. A definite winner. 10', '2005-11-30 00:55:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1906193, 262795, 14212, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting. 7</td>', 'Nice lighting. 7', '2005-11-30 00:55:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1906195, 262309, 41802, '<td valign="top">Wow this is an awesome shot!</td>', 'Wow this is an awesome shot!', '2005-11-30 00:55:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1906201, 261827, 31628, '<td valign="top">Nice reference!  Would benefit from an off-center composition.</td>', 'Nice reference!  Would benefit from an off-center composition.', '2005-11-30 00:57:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1906205, 262251, 42826, '<td valign="top">Wow, very hot shot!!!!  Very creative, nice lighting, nice angle!!!</td>', 'Wow, very hot shot!!!!  Very creative, nice lighting, nice angle!!!', '2005-11-30 00:57:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1906237, 263465, 33672, '<td valign="top">Nice take on the theme.</td>', 'Nice take on the theme.', '2005-11-30 01:02:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1906238, 263715, 39349, '<td valign="top">This looks all too familiar to me. My father worked for Utah Power &amp; Light for a very long time, and this looks JUST like Gatsby seam generation plant in downtown SLC. If it''s not it''s a very close match to a power plant in my home town. ;)<br/> <br/>About the shot. Beautiful, I love the yellows in the foreground and the lighting of the plant in the background. DOF is great and the motion blur of the trees gives this a feeling of surreal proportions. OUTSTANDING JOB! 10 from me.<br/> <br/> I had thought of shooting this but wasn''t sure if it would be okay or not.</td>', 'This looks all too familiar to me. My father worked for Utah Power & Light for a very long time, and this looks JUST like Gatsby seam generation plant in downtown SLC. If it''s not it''s a very close match to a power plant in my home town. ;) About the shot. Beautiful, I love the yellows in the foreground and the lighting of the plant in the background. DOF is great and the motion blur of the trees gives this a feeling of surreal proportions. OUTSTANDING JOB! 10 from me.  I had thought of shooting this but wasn''t sure if it would be okay or not.', '2005-11-30 01:02:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1906241, 263234, 39349, '<td valign="top">Great leading lines.</td>', 'Great leading lines.', '2005-11-30 01:02:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1906255, 263365, 36999, '<td valign="top">nice composition but I wish it were not so fuzzy</td>', 'nice composition but I wish it were not so fuzzy', '2005-11-30 01:04:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1906266, 263367, 39349, '<td valign="top">WOW beautiful colors working for you in this brilliant capture. Great job!</td>', 'WOW beautiful colors working for you in this brilliant capture. Great job!', '2005-11-30 01:05:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1906267, 262988, 36999, '<td valign="top">great color!</td>', 'great color!', '2005-11-30 01:05:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1906280, 263759, 39349, '<td valign="top">Love the coolness (is that a word?) this shot produces. I think you chose the right way to go with the grain and contrast you''ve used here. Great job.</td>', 'Love the coolness (is that a word?) this shot produces. I think you chose the right way to go with the grain and contrast you''ve used here. Great job.', '2005-11-30 01:08:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1906284, 262957, 26313, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. A few safety issues though!</td>', 'Nice shot. A few safety issues though!', '2005-11-30 01:08:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1906288, 261506, 30861, '<td valign="top">hah, wouldn''t this be PRE-industrial? jejeje It''s a nice shot :-)</td>', 'hah, wouldn''t this be PRE-industrial? jejeje It''s a nice shot :-)', '2005-11-30 01:09:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1906296, 263088, 47597, '<td valign="top">Love the subject and dusty feel. I wish the part of the roof wasn''t visible at the top left.</td>', 'Love the subject and dusty feel. I wish the part of the roof wasn''t visible at the top left.', '2005-11-30 01:10:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1906308, 262623, 47597, '<td valign="top">Love this. The glow of the sky is nice.</td>', 'Love this. The glow of the sky is nice.', '2005-11-30 01:13:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1906314, 263418, 46601, '<td valign="top">Background looks a little over overexposed ... nice perspective</td>', 'Background looks a little over overexposed ... nice perspective', '2005-11-30 01:14:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1906319, 262795, 10263, '<td valign="top">Amazing that something so stinky could be so beautiful. The colors are wonderful. I love the reflections and the smoke.</td>', 'Amazing that something so stinky could be so beautiful. The colors are wonderful. I love the reflections and the smoke.', '2005-11-30 01:15:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1906320, 262785, 43674, '<td valign="top">great underground shot. the atmosphere for being lit by only the headlamp is great</td>', 'great underground shot. the atmosphere for being lit by only the headlamp is great', '2005-11-30 01:16:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1906325, 263500, 47597, '<td valign="top">The subject is very distant and I can''t see any detail. The image is quite grainy too. The colours (esp. the tractors and the sea) seem too strong.</td>', 'The subject is very distant and I can''t see any detail. The image is quite grainy too. The colours (esp. the tractors and the sea) seem too strong.', '2005-11-30 01:17:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1906326, 262053, 47597, '<td valign="top">Wow pretty. Lovely shot.</td>', 'Wow pretty. Lovely shot.', '2005-11-30 01:17:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1906335, 262280, 47597, '<td valign="top">Seems stark with no "wow" for me.</td>', 'Seems stark with no "wow" for me.', '2005-11-30 01:20:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1906338, 262540, 46601, '<td valign="top">the large crane in the background is a little distracting .. though I like the idea</td>', 'the large crane in the background is a little distracting .. though I like the idea', '2005-11-30 01:20:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1906339, 263532, 10263, '<td valign="top">Wow what a contrast. This is wonderful. It would be a great photo even without the flowers in the foreground, but with them it is spectacular. How does anything grow in that cold!</td>', 'Wow what a contrast. This is wonderful. It would be a great photo even without the flowers in the foreground, but with them it is spectacular. How does anything grow in that cold!', '2005-11-30 01:20:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1906344, 261445, 39349, '<td valign="top">I love this shot, where is it? U.K? Why do I think of Pink Floyd when I''m looking at this? <br/> <br/>Okay, about your shot: Seems a bit dark on my end on the left hand side. I''m sure that''s due to your  primary light source coming from the right. This building has so much character show it off more! I think in this case you might want to bump up the brightness a tad to help this shot out. Also feels a bit heavy on the left. I use the Measure Tool in PhotoShop to correct tilted horizons like you have here. Finally, I think if you played with Hue/Saturation a bit I think it would bring out the blue and yellows in your sky and red tones in the power plant. I think this would make this shot just EXPODE off  the viewers monitor.<br/> <br/>I hope this helps and good luck with this challenge!</td>', 'I love this shot, where is it? U.K? Why do I think of Pink Floyd when I''m looking at this?  Okay, about your shot: Seems a bit dark on my end on the left hand side. I''m sure that''s due to your  primary light source coming from the right. This building has so much character show it off more! I think in this case you might want to bump up the brightness a tad to help this shot out. Also feels a bit heavy on the left. I use the Measure Tool in PhotoShop to correct tilted horizons like you have here. Finally, I think if you played with Hue/Saturation a bit I think it would bring out the blue and yellows in your sky and red tones in the power plant. I think this would make this shot just EXPODE off  the viewers monitor. I hope this helps and good luck with this challenge!', '2005-11-30 01:22:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1906346, 262036, 46601, '<td valign="top">perhaps if you cropped the top 1/3 off it might have given the re-bar a little more focus</td>', 'perhaps if you cropped the top 1/3 off it might have given the re-bar a little more focus', '2005-11-30 01:22:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1906349, 262988, 39349, '<td valign="top">Fantastic color range going on here. WOW!</td>', 'Fantastic color range going on here. WOW!', '2005-11-30 01:23:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1906354, 263735, 27133, '<td valign="top">Good setup for the challenge.  The dirt marks on the face don''t look realistic but I may be wrong.  I would be very interested to see where this was taken as I have not seen a cap lamp like that before.  Good lighting over his face.  I really like the bloodshot eyes.</td>', 'Good setup for the challenge.  The dirt marks on the face don''t look realistic but I may be wrong.  I would be very interested to see where this was taken as I have not seen a cap lamp like that before.  Good lighting over his face.  I really like the bloodshot eyes.', '2005-11-30 01:24:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1906356, 261477, 46601, '<td valign="top">a little hard to see what this is ...</td>', 'a little hard to see what this is ...', '2005-11-30 01:25:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1906357, 262154, 15711, '<td valign="top">I like the perspective and the composition but it''s screaming post editing to me.  Sepia?  Or perhaps black and white?  Maybe adjusting curves would have given it some oomph. 7</td>', 'I like the perspective and the composition but it''s screaming post editing to me.  Sepia?  Or perhaps black and white?  Maybe adjusting curves would have given it some oomph. 7', '2005-11-30 01:25:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1906365, 261627, 30861, '<td valign="top">I wish you''d let this be darker. About a stop or a zone darker. I can see the "night" upper left, I can see potential, but overal it lacks the impact it could have :-( 6</td>', 'I wish you''d let this be darker. About a stop or a zone darker. I can see the "night" upper left, I can see potential, but overal it lacks the impact it could have :-( 6', '2005-11-30 01:26:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1906370, 263355, 15711, '<td valign="top">I like the composition. This would be great with a curves adjustment.</td>', 'I like the composition. This would be great with a curves adjustment.', '2005-11-30 01:27:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1906371, 263362, 46601, '<td valign="top">Love the smoke with the sun behind it ... great pic</td>', 'Love the smoke with the sun behind it ... great pic', '2005-11-30 01:27:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1906373, 262309, 46601, '<td valign="top">Nice idea .. but a little washed out for my taste</td>', 'Nice idea .. but a little washed out for my taste', '2005-11-30 01:28:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1906375, 263755, 5885, '<td valign="top">lmfao... I know that feeling....</td>', 'lmfao... I know that feeling....', '2005-11-30 01:29:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1906378, 261627, 36999, '<td valign="top">love the composition</td>', 'love the composition', '2005-11-30 01:29:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1906380, 263769, 39349, '<td valign="top">Okay I love the steam/smoke/sky tones very cool and along with the plant it fits the challenge perfectly. However,  I''m not sure how I''m liking the trees in the foreground though. I see what you were going for hiding the (refinery I''m guessing) plant but I guess I would have liked to see more detail in the foreground subjects as well. 6 for awesome contrast in the sky and tack sharp detail in the plant structures.</td>', 'Okay I love the steam/smoke/sky tones very cool and along with the plant it fits the challenge perfectly. However,  I''m not sure how I''m liking the trees in the foreground though. I see what you were going for hiding the (refinery I''m guessing) plant but I guess I would have liked to see more detail in the foreground subjects as well. 6 for awesome contrast in the sky and tack sharp detail in the plant structures.', '2005-11-30 01:29:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1906383, 263532, 46601, '<td valign="top">Love the contrast here ... great idea</td>', 'Love the contrast here ... great idea', '2005-11-30 01:30:44.000000', NULL, 1),
