(1906450, 262984, 46601, '<td valign="top">great colours ... love the reflection</td>', 'great colours ... love the reflection', '2005-11-30 01:47:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1906457, 261921, 39349, '<td valign="top">Okay, I haven''t been to Seattle, YET but soon, very soon! I really like this shot but the one thing that is hurting it IMHO is the shape in the upper right hand corner. It''s taking away from the space needle that you''ve captured so clearly and wonderfully.</td>', 'Okay, I haven''t been to Seattle, YET but soon, very soon! I really like this shot but the one thing that is hurting it IMHO is the shape in the upper right hand corner. It''s taking away from the space needle that you''ve captured so clearly and wonderfully.', '2005-11-30 01:48:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1906460, 263655, 39349, '<td valign="top">Beautiful blue tones against the yellow and orange of the fading sunlight.</td>', 'Beautiful blue tones against the yellow and orange of the fading sunlight.', '2005-11-30 01:49:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1906464, 261959, 32608, '<td valign="top">wow,  looks like to is breathing.  good shot.</td>', 'wow,  looks like to is breathing.  good shot.', '2005-11-30 01:50:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1906472, 262953, 39349, '<td valign="top">Great capture. Really nails the challenge details. I''m not sure about two things though, first it seems a bit blurry to me. Secondly, I''m not sure if it''s the power lines / pole but it seems tilted to the left.<br/> <br/>The more I look at this the more I think it''s just an illusion with the pole thing...<br/> <br/>Steam/Smoke is captured well.</td>', 'Great capture. Really nails the challenge details. I''m not sure about two things though, first it seems a bit blurry to me. Secondly, I''m not sure if it''s the power lines / pole but it seems tilted to the left. The more I look at this the more I think it''s just an illusion with the pole thing... Steam/Smoke is captured well.', '2005-11-30 01:54:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1906483, 261414, 39349, '<td valign="top">Washing machine? Nice red and orange  tones but overall the shot just isn''t working for me. I might suggest trying a different perspective next time. Maybe a more symmetrical approach.</td>', 'Washing machine? Nice red and orange  tones but overall the shot just isn''t working for me. I might suggest trying a different perspective next time. Maybe a more symmetrical approach.', '2005-11-30 01:59:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1906500, 263603, 39349, '<td valign="top">Little too dark for my tastes. I do like the star burst effects you have going on with the lights.</td>', 'Little too dark for my tastes. I do like the star burst effects you have going on with the lights.', '2005-11-30 02:03:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1906533, 261959, 39349, '<td valign="top">Okay, first off when this shot came across my screen while voting I said, "HOLY SHHH@T COOL!" So with that I think you''ve got something totally out of the box here. I''m loving this as a piece of digital art; I do believe you''ve crossed the line between a photograph and art here. I''m not saying that as a bad thing so please don''t take it that way.<br/> <br/>Colors are amazing; your use of blue, yellow, grey and black all work well to create drama and wonderful contrast. Good luck.</td>', 'Okay, first off when this shot came across my screen while voting I said, "HOLY SHHH@T COOL!" So with that I think you''ve got something totally out of the box here. I''m loving this as a piece of digital art; I do believe you''ve crossed the line between a photograph and art here. I''m not saying that as a bad thing so please don''t take it that way. Colors are amazing; your use of blue, yellow, grey and black all work well to create drama and wonderful contrast. Good luck.', '2005-11-30 02:10:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1906544, 262251, 39349, '<td valign="top">Okay, that''s got to hurt! Props to your beautiful model for enduring some pain for the sake of the shot. Fantastic idea but the only thing that''s not working for me is that it seems a bit over done with the neat image. Still a 9 from me.</td>', 'Okay, that''s got to hurt! Props to your beautiful model for enduring some pain for the sake of the shot. Fantastic idea but the only thing that''s not working for me is that it seems a bit over done with the neat image. Still a 9 from me.', '2005-11-30 02:12:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1906591, 262251, 10170, '<td valign="top">Lovely take on the industrial theme.  You got the sparks perfectly.  Really lovely curves on the model.  10 (and added to my favourites)</td>', 'Lovely take on the industrial theme.  You got the sparks perfectly.  Really lovely curves on the model.  10 (and added to my favourites)', '2005-11-30 02:24:49.000000', NULL, 1),
