(1906962, 262984, 48545, '<td valign="top">Great picture, however I really don''t get an ''industry feel'' from it</td>', 'Great picture, however I really don''t get an ''industry feel'' from it', '2005-11-30 08:21:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1906963, 263174, 15711, '<td valign="top">I really like the idea of the old rusted vehicle, but I think it loses impact due to the tight crop.  It''s almost "too close," if you get my drift.  I think if you included more of the field, or land around it, you''d tell more of a story.  I think the overhead perspective kind of loses something too. Maybe sit down on the ground, looking across the area instead of looming over it. Hope you find this helpful.</td>', 'I really like the idea of the old rusted vehicle, but I think it loses impact due to the tight crop.  It''s almost "too close," if you get my drift.  I think if you included more of the field, or land around it, you''d tell more of a story.  I think the overhead perspective kind of loses something too. Maybe sit down on the ground, looking across the area instead of looming over it. Hope you find this helpful.', '2005-11-30 08:23:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1906964, 262978, 15711, '<td valign="top">I just love the smokestack with the movmement of the smoke/steam. The tree in the foreground helps give it some perspective. I wish that the ground in the foreground wasn''t so blacked out. Maybe that''s due to the time of day. Or perhaps, convert to black and white and it might be more effective. Still, well composed. 7</td>', 'I just love the smokestack with the movmement of the smoke/steam. The tree in the foreground helps give it some perspective. I wish that the ground in the foreground wasn''t so blacked out. Maybe that''s due to the time of day. Or perhaps, convert to black and white and it might be more effective. Still, well composed. 7', '2005-11-30 08:24:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1906966, 262071, 15711, '<td valign="top">Oh cool. I like the round archway leading up the the tall flame.  The symmetry is perfect and works in this instance. 8</td>', 'Oh cool. I like the round archway leading up the the tall flame.  The symmetry is perfect and works in this instance. 8', '2005-11-30 08:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1906968, 262984, 38032, '<td valign="top">ribbon - this is beautiful ... and basiv editting too! ... 9</td>', 'ribbon - this is beautiful ... and basiv editting too! ... 9', '2005-11-30 08:26:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1906970, 263465, 38032, '<td valign="top">9  -nice - great juxtaposition of perspectives!!!!</td>', '9  -nice - great juxtaposition of perspectives!!!!', '2005-11-30 08:27:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1906971, 263735, 15711, '<td valign="top">OH this is great.  I didn''t think I''d see any humans in this challenge so this is a pleasant surprise. The clarity of his right eye is awesome. The use of negative space creates a nice composition. I like the crop over his hat and the tiny reflection of the light on the snap of his shirt, which helps bring your eyd down.  Well done!!  10</td>', 'OH this is great.  I didn''t think I''d see any humans in this challenge so this is a pleasant surprise. The clarity of his right eye is awesome. The use of negative space creates a nice composition. I like the crop over his hat and the tiny reflection of the light on the snap of his shirt, which helps bring your eyd down.  Well done!!  10', '2005-11-30 08:27:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1906973, 262558, 45316, '<td valign="top">Very strange lighting and colours, almost unreal.  Makes it more appealing. The  straws add something to it also. 8</td>', 'Very strange lighting and colours, almost unreal.  Makes it more appealing. The  straws add something to it also. 8', '2005-11-30 08:27:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1906975, 263548, 48298, '<td valign="top">This is a different take on the subject.  I like it!</td>', 'This is a different take on the subject.  I like it!', '2005-11-30 08:28:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1906977, 263206, 38032, '<td valign="top">cool - love the simpicity 7</td>', 'cool - love the simpicity 7', '2005-11-30 08:28:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1906978, 263493, 15711, '<td valign="top">This isn''t that unusual, but what makes it work for me is the filtration. It reminds me of an old postcard from an earlier time. I like the black of the smoke mixed with the white of the steam rising up out of the smaller stacks. The horizontal sense of the four main stacks is interesting to the eye and the crop gives you a sense that you are seeing everything, yet it''s not panned back too far.  Well done. 8</td>', 'This isn''t that unusual, but what makes it work for me is the filtration. It reminds me of an old postcard from an earlier time. I like the black of the smoke mixed with the white of the steam rising up out of the smaller stacks. The horizontal sense of the four main stacks is interesting to the eye and the crop gives you a sense that you are seeing everything, yet it''s not panned back too far.  Well done. 8', '2005-11-30 08:29:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1906980, 262067, 48298, '<td valign="top">Hey, this is cool, with the graffiti!  Good find!</td>', 'Hey, this is cool, with the graffiti!  Good find!', '2005-11-30 08:29:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1906984, 263261, 15711, '<td valign="top">Interesting. I like interjecting the human form into this challenge of buildings and smoke stacks.  The lighting is great. I think (to be nit picky) a well tanned or sleeved arm might''ve conveyed the message even further.  But having said that, the lighting is awesome, and the use of negative space helps give this impact.  The movement of pulling on the right glove helps bring the message home. I like the title too~~ Well done. 9</td>', 'Interesting. I like interjecting the human form into this challenge of buildings and smoke stacks.  The lighting is great. I think (to be nit picky) a well tanned or sleeved arm might''ve conveyed the message even further.  But having said that, the lighting is awesome, and the use of negative space helps give this impact.  The movement of pulling on the right glove helps bring the message home. I like the title too~~ Well done. 9', '2005-11-30 08:31:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1906986, 263466, 15711, '<td valign="top">I like the simplicity of this. I wonder if you did single color adjustments of both black and neutral and brought up the black - it would create more contrast, but wouldn''t make the white any whiter.  Hmmm - just a thought.</td>', 'I like the simplicity of this. I wonder if you did single color adjustments of both black and neutral and brought up the black - it would create more contrast, but wouldn''t make the white any whiter.  Hmmm - just a thought.', '2005-11-30 08:33:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1906987, 263596, 15711, '<td valign="top">Oh I love this.  The visual with the perfect symmetry including the diagonal sense is very interesting to the eye.  I like the bronze coloration of the stacks with the pale aqua of the sky.  That hint of golden orange of the railings (scaffolding?) realy helps too. This is great. 9</td>', 'Oh I love this.  The visual with the perfect symmetry including the diagonal sense is very interesting to the eye.  I like the bronze coloration of the stacks with the pale aqua of the sky.  That hint of golden orange of the railings (scaffolding?) realy helps too. This is great. 9', '2005-11-30 08:34:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1906988, 261921, 15711, '<td valign="top">Nice leading line. The lighting really caps it off.  Nice job.</td>', 'Nice leading line. The lighting really caps it off.  Nice job.', '2005-11-30 08:35:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1906989, 263547, 15711, '<td valign="top">I love the movement of the steam/smoke.  The blur of the lights on the water helps add to the shot. I''d do a bit of saturation work to really up the sky and wate tonesr.</td>', 'I love the movement of the steam/smoke.  The blur of the lights on the water helps add to the shot. I''d do a bit of saturation work to really up the sky and wate tonesr.', '2005-11-30 08:35:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1906990, 263650, 15711, '<td valign="top">I like the leading line.  Great symmetry. This would look cool in sepia or black and white as well, for a fun variation. 7</td>', 'I like the leading line.  Great symmetry. This would look cool in sepia or black and white as well, for a fun variation. 7', '2005-11-30 08:36:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1906992, 262795, 15711, '<td valign="top">AWESOME!!  The smoke/steam looks like velvet. The lighting is beautiful. I love the reflective quality of this shot as well.  Good job. 9</td>', 'AWESOME!!  The smoke/steam looks like velvet. The lighting is beautiful. I love the reflective quality of this shot as well.  Good job. 9', '2005-11-30 08:37:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1906994, 263248, 15711, '<td valign="top">I like the dead center approach you chose. The leading line of the bridge really works. Nicely done. 8</td>', 'I like the dead center approach you chose. The leading line of the bridge really works. Nicely done. 8', '2005-11-30 08:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1906995, 261420, 15711, '<td valign="top">Love the lighting and the use of black and white.  The repetition of the desks works. I like the diagonal sense of it as well.  Sometimes the monotony of things creates the WOW factor and this is a perfect example. 8</td>', 'Love the lighting and the use of black and white.  The repetition of the desks works. I like the diagonal sense of it as well.  Sometimes the monotony of things creates the WOW factor and this is a perfect example. 8', '2005-11-30 08:39:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1906997, 263769, 15711, '<td valign="top">I love the billowing steam/smoke leading your eye from left to right. I''d up the blue saturation even further.</td>', 'I love the billowing steam/smoke leading your eye from left to right. I''d up the blue saturation even further.', '2005-11-30 08:39:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1907000, 263768, 15711, '<td valign="top">Perfect title!! I like the flair of the lights too.</td>', 'Perfect title!! I like the flair of the lights too.', '2005-11-30 08:40:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1907007, 263715, 15711, '<td valign="top">WOW - I''d never think I''d say that a shot like this is beautiful but it is.  The colors, the clarity and the flair of the lights!  I think what truly does it for me though, is the yellow tree in the lower right. It adds complementary tgones to the blues. The tree branches in the upper right are like fingers reaching out to touch the smoke stacks. The tree branch in the upper left helps balance it tout. This is great!! 10</td>', 'WOW - I''d never think I''d say that a shot like this is beautiful but it is.  The colors, the clarity and the flair of the lights!  I think what truly does it for me though, is the yellow tree in the lower right. It adds complementary tgones to the blues. The tree branches in the upper right are like fingers reaching out to touch the smoke stacks. The tree branch in the upper left helps balance it tout. This is great!! 10', '2005-11-30 08:42:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1907008, 263128, 15711, '<td valign="top">I like the minimalist approach.  But it loses impact due to the small size. Try to utilize the maximum 650 pixels to make a larger image.</td>', 'I like the minimalist approach.  But it loses impact due to the small size. Try to utilize the maximum 650 pixels to make a larger image.', '2005-11-30 08:43:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1907042, 263628, 15711, '<td valign="top">I''m amazed at how such a simple shot can be so artful. It''s like the moon was "shot" out of the pipe that leads your eye through the shot.  I like the brown/blue tonal combination. Nice.    8</td>', 'I''m amazed at how such a simple shot can be so artful. It''s like the moon was "shot" out of the pipe that leads your eye through the shot.  I like the brown/blue tonal combination. Nice.    8', '2005-11-30 09:03:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1907050, 263362, 43774, '<td valign="top">There are a lot of smoke and evening shots in this challenge, this is the best one and one of the top images overall. Well done.</td>', 'There are a lot of smoke and evening shots in this challenge, this is the best one and one of the top images overall. Well done.', '2005-11-30 09:06:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1907051, 262221, 43774, '<td valign="top">Love the blue sky and the contrails add even more industry to the shot.</td>', 'Love the blue sky and the contrails add even more industry to the shot.', '2005-11-30 09:07:10.000000', NULL, 1),
