(1907105, 263463, 47919, '<td valign="top">OK, This is one for the "How''d they do that?" section. Is this actually a photo of a pigeon hitting a window? If so, I''m amazed that not only were you able to do that, but that the image is aesthetically interesting as well. It''s even fits in the challenge.</td>', 'OK, This is one for the "How''d they do that?" section. Is this actually a photo of a pigeon hitting a window? If so, I''m amazed that not only were you able to do that, but that the image is aesthetically interesting as well. It''s even fits in the challenge.', '2005-11-30 09:20:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1907148, 263125, 47919, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. Compositionally, the diagonals work really well to move you through the image. I wish it something more to hold my attention as a focal point. Without that those diagonals on the right move me right out of the image almost as quickly as the ones on the left brought me in.</td>', 'Nice shot. Compositionally, the diagonals work really well to move you through the image. I wish it something more to hold my attention as a focal point. Without that those diagonals on the right move me right out of the image almost as quickly as the ones on the left brought me in.', '2005-11-30 09:45:39.000000', NULL, 1),
