(1907270, 262953, 45857, '<td valign="top">Your image is very busy and industrious, it has dirty ''oily'' feel to it<br/>I like how you attempted to frame you subject area with the utility poles. I thinkb a tighter crop, just to the left of the second pole would have been more efective. I also wonder what difference a step or two to the right might have made.</td>', 'Your image is very busy and industrious, it has dirty ''oily'' feel to itI like how you attempted to frame you subject area with the utility poles. I thinkb a tighter crop, just to the left of the second pole would have been more efective. I also wonder what difference a step or two to the right might have made.', '2005-11-30 10:29:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1907274, 263509, 42808, '<td valign="top">Good image of an industrial "city" and probably looks good in B&amp;W also.</td>', 'Good image of an industrial "city" and probably looks good in B&W also.', '2005-11-30 10:33:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1907276, 262984, 42808, '<td valign="top">great capture and cool reflection and colors</td>', 'great capture and cool reflection and colors', '2005-11-30 10:34:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1907277, 263536, 45857, '<td valign="top">I really like how you have used all the elements in this image. Verticals v. horizotals. light v dark. linear v impled curves.</td>', 'I really like how you have used all the elements in this image. Verticals v. horizotals. light v dark. linear v impled curves.', '2005-11-30 10:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1907278, 263619, 31115, '<td valign="top">Nice photo.</td>', 'Nice photo.', '2005-11-30 10:35:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1907279, 261959, 42808, '<td valign="top">incredible image--very dramatic events</td>', 'incredible image--very dramatic events', '2005-11-30 10:36:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1907280, 263248, 48786, '<td valign="top">I saw this photo before and didn''t really think that much of it then, but when reconsidering it for this vote I''ve discovered that if I ignore the fact that I know it''s the underside of a bridge and look at it from a fresh point of view it''s actually very striking. I like the almost perfect symmetry, and it does look very industrial. Almost like the base of some weird machine, or a UFO.</td>', 'I saw this photo before and didn''t really think that much of it then, but when reconsidering it for this vote I''ve discovered that if I ignore the fact that I know it''s the underside of a bridge and look at it from a fresh point of view it''s actually very striking. I like the almost perfect symmetry, and it does look very industrial. Almost like the base of some weird machine, or a UFO.', '2005-11-30 10:36:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1907281, 262984, 31115, '<td valign="top">Great shot.</td>', 'Great shot.', '2005-11-30 10:37:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1907282, 262795, 31115, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot. This is what I was going for.</td>', 'Very nice shot. This is what I was going for.', '2005-11-30 10:37:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1907286, 262251, 47919, '<td valign="top">Excellent contrast in textures<br/></td>', 'Excellent contrast in textures', '2005-11-30 10:40:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1907287, 262770, 45857, '<td valign="top">This is a well composed image, the long exposure effect works well, but I''m not so sure about the sepia tones.</td>', 'This is a well composed image, the long exposure effect works well, but I''m not so sure about the sepia tones.', '2005-11-30 10:40:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1907291, 262036, 45857, '<td valign="top">I like the angularity here, but the top 1/5 of the frame is ''dead'' space'', I think it would work better cropped close to the horizontal line of the white pipes.</td>', 'I like the angularity here, but the top 1/5 of the frame is ''dead'' space'', I think it would work better cropped close to the horizontal line of the white pipes.', '2005-11-30 10:44:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1907298, 263064, 45857, '<td valign="top">A fundimental approach, perhaps inline with the heavy duty - rugged definition of industrial.</td>', 'A fundimental approach, perhaps inline with the heavy duty - rugged definition of industrial.', '2005-11-30 10:50:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1907303, 262265, 45857, '<td valign="top">Good abstraction of your title, I like the creativity here.</td>', 'Good abstraction of your title, I like the creativity here.', '2005-11-30 10:52:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1907305, 261445, 34194, '<td valign="top">Too dark for my taste</td>', 'Too dark for my taste', '2005-11-30 10:54:50.000000', NULL, 1),
