(1907346, 263548, 18073, '<td valign="top">It has a nice graphic feel to it, love the rich blue and then the rather pale and colourless factory, its a nice contrast.  The only thing I find a little distracting is that it looks a little uneven, but this may of course be becaus the building is falling appart.<br/> <br/>Over all I quite like this shot 6/10</td>', 'It has a nice graphic feel to it, love the rich blue and then the rather pale and colourless factory, its a nice contrast.  The only thing I find a little distracting is that it looks a little uneven, but this may of course be becaus the building is falling appart. Over all I quite like this shot 6/10', '2005-11-30 11:14:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1907347, 263735, 34194, '<td valign="top">powerful image</td>', 'powerful image', '2005-11-30 11:15:44.000000', NULL, 1),
