(1907761, 262859, 45790, '<td valign="top">Works well and graininess is a plus. There is a strange "O" in the smoke. Also good thing there is no "scratch ''n sniff" feature.</td>', 'Works well and graininess is a plus. There is a strange "O" in the smoke. Also good thing there is no "scratch ''n sniff" feature.', '2005-11-30 13:57:33.000000', NULL, 1),
