(1907788, 262835, 43774, '<td valign="top">Not bad, seems to be a lot of empty space at top. Maybe if you had zoomed in on one particular part of the factory, thus eliminating the empty space.</td>', 'Not bad, seems to be a lot of empty space at top. Maybe if you had zoomed in on one particular part of the factory, thus eliminating the empty space.', '2005-11-30 14:09:55.000000', NULL, 1),
