(1907794, 262953, 43774, '<td valign="top">Nice, looks tilted to the right a little. Could you have zoomed closer to get rid of the power lines?  I realize this is an industrial challenge but the lines and that pole are distracting.</td>', 'Nice, looks tilted to the right a little. Could you have zoomed closer to get rid of the power lines?  I realize this is an industrial challenge but the lines and that pole are distracting.', '2005-11-30 14:11:39.000000', NULL, 1),
