(1907808, 262835, 45857, '<td valign="top">I like the smudged skies, the streaked steam. This has good intensity, which may have been strong in a tighter crop, perhaps too much negative space at the top.</td>', 'I like the smudged skies, the streaked steam. This has good intensity, which may have been strong in a tighter crop, perhaps too much negative space at the top.', '2005-11-30 14:14:48.000000', NULL, 1),
