(1908161, 263256, 45928, '<td valign="top">A bit oversharpened, but otherwise a nice picture.</td>', 'A bit oversharpened, but otherwise a nice picture.', '2005-11-30 15:42:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1908162, 261921, 45857, '<td valign="top">Striking image, not sure of the industrial context, then I don''t know that much about the Space Needle</td>', 'Striking image, not sure of the industrial context, then I don''t know that much about the Space Needle', '2005-11-30 15:42:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1908166, 263537, 45360, '<td valign="top">Nice idea but I think it would have benefitted from tighter cropping.</td>', 'Nice idea but I think it would have benefitted from tighter cropping.', '2005-11-30 15:43:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1908167, 263525, 45857, '<td valign="top">Very moody piece, I like the dark to light progression within the context or revolution</td>', 'Very moody piece, I like the dark to light progression within the context or revolution', '2005-11-30 15:43:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1908177, 263206, 45928, '<td valign="top">Sorry about that last comment. Very nice picture, could use a bigger point of interest though.</td>', 'Sorry about that last comment. Very nice picture, could use a bigger point of interest though.', '2005-11-30 15:47:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1908179, 263028, 4477, '<td valign="top">I really like how you''ve captured the row of homes.</td>', 'I really like how you''ve captured the row of homes.', '2005-11-30 15:48:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1908185, 262240, 38234, '<td valign="top">nice shot but the sky''s a bit blown and I think more detail could be brought out of the shadows</td>', 'nice shot but the sky''s a bit blown and I think more detail could be brought out of the shadows', '2005-11-30 15:49:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1908188, 263755, 38234, '<td valign="top">really soft focus - and yellow cast</td>', 'really soft focus - and yellow cast', '2005-11-30 15:49:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1908190, 262836, 41337, '<td valign="top">The top part has nice contrast but the bottom is real dull and underexposed. Maybe that''s the feeling you were after but I think I would have preferred using a  gradient filter or a stronger one to bring out more detail from the bottom.</td>', 'The top part has nice contrast but the bottom is real dull and underexposed. Maybe that''s the feeling you were after but I think I would have preferred using a  gradient filter or a stronger one to bring out more detail from the bottom.', '2005-11-30 15:49:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1908192, 262221, 4477, '<td valign="top">Great perspective shot. The border adds a nice touch too.</td>', 'Great perspective shot. The border adds a nice touch too.', '2005-11-30 15:50:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1908193, 263463, 4477, '<td valign="top">WEIRD!  Really neat find and image!</td>', 'WEIRD!  Really neat find and image!', '2005-11-30 15:50:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1908197, 263762, 41337, '<td valign="top">The highlights especially look a bit distorted. Looks like too much neatimage.</td>', 'The highlights especially look a bit distorted. Looks like too much neatimage.', '2005-11-30 15:51:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1908204, 262901, 38234, '<td valign="top">I don''t know what M56 is and this image is too dark for me to figure it out:-(</td>', 'I don''t know what M56 is and this image is too dark for me to figure it out:-(', '2005-11-30 15:53:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1908208, 262394, 38234, '<td valign="top">great shot!!!</td>', 'great shot!!!', '2005-11-30 15:55:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1908211, 263463, 41337, '<td valign="top">Very interesting. Kinda looks like an x-ray shot. On the negative, the contrast is too low.</td>', 'Very interesting. Kinda looks like an x-ray shot. On the negative, the contrast is too low.', '2005-11-30 15:56:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1908213, 262432, 38234, '<td valign="top">reall soft focus</td>', 'reall soft focus', '2005-11-30 15:58:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1908214, 263519, 45360, '<td valign="top">Nice idea and well lit but I feel the caution sticker draws the eye away from the drill bit.</td>', 'Nice idea and well lit but I feel the caution sticker draws the eye away from the drill bit.', '2005-11-30 15:58:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1908215, 262221, 45857, '<td valign="top">I like the symmetry you have here.</td>', 'I like the symmetry you have here.', '2005-11-30 15:58:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1908220, 263362, 41337, '<td valign="top">A ribbon winner. Man that''s cool looking.</td>', 'A ribbon winner. Man that''s cool looking.', '2005-11-30 15:59:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1908228, 263735, 38234, '<td valign="top">GREAT entry!!!</td>', 'GREAT entry!!!', '2005-11-30 16:00:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1908230, 263715, 41337, '<td valign="top">Like the colors and composition but too much color noise and the dof could be better.</td>', 'Like the colors and composition but too much color noise and the dof could be better.', '2005-11-30 16:01:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1908232, 263716, 41337, '<td valign="top">Interesting but I don''t like the border being that thick.</td>', 'Interesting but I don''t like the border being that thick.', '2005-11-30 16:01:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1908233, 263546, 46214, '<td valign="top">a bit to much background I cant see the waste</td>', 'a bit to much background I cant see the waste', '2005-11-30 16:01:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1908235, 263216, 45857, '<td valign="top">Wonderful skies, like the sepia here, perhaps cold blue would have been interesting too.</td>', 'Wonderful skies, like the sepia here, perhaps cold blue would have been interesting too.', '2005-11-30 16:02:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1908240, 261361, 41337, '<td valign="top">I like the composition.</td>', 'I like the composition.', '2005-11-30 16:04:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1908261, 262271, 38234, '<td valign="top">beautifully composed and great industrial feel to it!!</td>', 'beautifully composed and great industrial feel to it!!', '2005-11-30 16:09:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1908266, 262861, 46463, '<td valign="top">can''t see this picture fitting in with the title ''industry''</td>', 'can''t see this picture fitting in with the title ''industry''', '2005-11-30 16:11:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1908268, 262118, 45857, '<td valign="top">Good gritty feel to this one, sodium vapor greens work well.</td>', 'Good gritty feel to this one, sodium vapor greens work well.', '2005-11-30 16:11:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1908269, 261679, 3087, '<td valign="top">Is this the British Museum? Awesome pic, wherever it is! Love it!</td>', 'Is this the British Museum? Awesome pic, wherever it is! Love it!', '2005-11-30 16:11:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1908282, 262394, 3087, '<td valign="top">Nice silhouette, I really like the composition and use of negative space. Unusually, the completely white sky really adds to this image; normally it''s a turn off.</td>', 'Nice silhouette, I really like the composition and use of negative space. Unusually, the completely white sky really adds to this image; normally it''s a turn off.', '2005-11-30 16:16:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1908285, 263028, 3087, '<td valign="top">Many interesting details - the dwarved houses in the foreground, the hazy view of the city behind, the repetition of the stacks and the steam/ smoke cloud. But foreground feels too busy to me and keeps drawing my eye away from the really industrial centre ground.</td>', 'Many interesting details - the dwarved houses in the foreground, the hazy view of the city behind, the repetition of the stacks and the steam/ smoke cloud. But foreground feels too busy to me and keeps drawing my eye away from the really industrial centre ground.', '2005-11-30 16:18:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1908287, 262543, 3087, '<td valign="top">What an intriguing (and well framed) image. I love the use of silhouette and that mysterious light at the gate has me hooked. The details of the corridor beyond the gate, particularly the cobbles, are also interesting.</td>', 'What an intriguing (and well framed) image. I love the use of silhouette and that mysterious light at the gate has me hooked. The details of the corridor beyond the gate, particularly the cobbles, are also interesting.', '2005-11-30 16:19:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1908290, 263715, 3087, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and nice use of framing using three different trees/ bushes. I like the three stacked columns and the way they provide both a strong vertical as well as a diagonal. The colours of the lights are also really ineresting. Works well for me.</td>', 'Nice composition and nice use of framing using three different trees/ bushes. I like the three stacked columns and the way they provide both a strong vertical as well as a diagonal. The colours of the lights are also really ineresting. Works well for me.', '2005-11-30 16:20:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1908291, 263143, 42608, '<td valign="top">Nice mood, but what i like are the refections off all the cars.</td>', 'Nice mood, but what i like are the refections off all the cars.', '2005-11-30 16:21:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1908293, 263257, 3087, '<td valign="top">Quirky and bold composition. Like the way most tones are red ones. Think this is a really unusual and successful image.</td>', 'Quirky and bold composition. Like the way most tones are red ones. Think this is a really unusual and successful image.', '2005-11-30 16:21:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1908296, 263362, 42608, '<td valign="top">very nice.</td>', 'very nice.', '2005-11-30 16:22:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1908299, 263468, 3087, '<td valign="top">Like the colours and diagonal composition. Nice long exposure on the steam clouds.</td>', 'Like the colours and diagonal composition. Nice long exposure on the steam clouds.', '2005-11-30 16:23:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1908303, 262908, 42608, '<td valign="top">Good composition, although I think the person in front of the sun should have been darkened to remove the glow from him.</td>', 'Good composition, although I think the person in front of the sun should have been darkened to remove the glow from him.', '2005-11-30 16:23:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1908307, 263735, 42608, '<td valign="top">Nice mood.</td>', 'Nice mood.', '2005-11-30 16:24:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1908310, 262795, 3087, '<td valign="top">Some intriguing shapes in the steam clouds - how strange that they are all going in different directions - must be some interesting wind currents! Makes for a fascinating image though composition doesn''t feel balanced, left to right, for me. Either more space to the left so that the main interest is on the right hand side of the frame or less space there to make it more centred would work better for me.</td>', 'Some intriguing shapes in the steam clouds - how strange that they are all going in different directions - must be some interesting wind currents! Makes for a fascinating image though composition doesn''t feel balanced, left to right, for me. Either more space to the left so that the main interest is on the right hand side of the frame or less space there to make it more centred would work better for me.', '2005-11-30 16:24:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1908315, 262606, 42608, '<td valign="top">I really like the grain in this,  in combo with the fog and bold front chimney.</td>', 'I really like the grain in this,  in combo with the fog and bold front chimney.', '2005-11-30 16:25:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1908320, 262785, 3087, '<td valign="top">Nice portrait - like how he''s illuminated by a spot of light amidst the dark. Focus seems soft on his face.</td>', 'Nice portrait - like how he''s illuminated by a spot of light amidst the dark. Focus seems soft on his face.', '2005-11-30 16:26:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1908323, 263716, 3087, '<td valign="top">Like the high grain with the black and white treatment. Interestingly minimal interms of detail. Nice perspective. Dislike the heavy border.</td>', 'Like the high grain with the black and white treatment. Interestingly minimal interms of detail. Nice perspective. Dislike the heavy border.', '2005-11-30 16:27:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1908329, 261490, 42608, '<td valign="top">so many lines....crazy but cool.</td>', 'so many lines....crazy but cool.', '2005-11-30 16:27:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1908338, 261420, 3087, '<td valign="top">Great use of repetition and I really like the hard light and shadows together with a high contrast black and white presentation.</td>', 'Great use of repetition and I really like the hard light and shadows together with a high contrast black and white presentation.', '2005-11-30 16:29:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1908348, 263362, 3087, '<td valign="top">Great positioning to achieve a wonderful backlit silhouette. I like the way it makes such a strong diagonal across the frame. Personally, I''d crop the building out completely so we had a really surprising presentation of a vast cloud billowing from a tiny chimney.</td>', 'Great positioning to achieve a wonderful backlit silhouette. I like the way it makes such a strong diagonal across the frame. Personally, I''d crop the building out completely so we had a really surprising presentation of a vast cloud billowing from a tiny chimney.', '2005-11-30 16:31:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1908350, 263768, 48867, '<td valign="top">Very nice picture... takes me off to oz... u have potential :-)</td>', 'Very nice picture... takes me off to oz... u have potential :-)', '2005-11-30 16:32:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1908351, 262071, 3087, '<td valign="top">Interesting! Almost a geometric abstract and yet the textures and materials give a strongly industrial feel. Also has both a spiritual and a sci-fi touch to it.</td>', 'Interesting! Almost a geometric abstract and yet the textures and materials give a strongly industrial feel. Also has both a spiritual and a sci-fi touch to it.', '2005-11-30 16:32:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1908354, 263650, 46586, '<td valign="top">Damn...I wish the last lamp wasn''t cropped :/ 7</td>', 'Damn...I wish the last lamp wasn''t cropped :/ 7', '2005-11-30 16:32:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1908356, 263532, 3087, '<td valign="top">I like the way we can see the industrial plant surrounded by a natural environment. The muted colours of everything but the foreground trees works well. With the steam and the chimney mirroring each other it feels a little to centred horizontally for my preferences.</td>', 'I like the way we can see the industrial plant surrounded by a natural environment. The muted colours of everything but the foreground trees works well. With the steam and the chimney mirroring each other it feels a little to centred horizontally for my preferences.', '2005-11-30 16:34:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1908360, 262079, 3087, '<td valign="top">The tiny white pinpricks of light really lift this image. I like the space you''ve given to the sky and sea - gives an interesting idea of scale.</td>', 'The tiny white pinpricks of light really lift this image. I like the space you''ve given to the sky and sea - gives an interesting idea of scale.', '2005-11-30 16:35:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1908361, 263110, 45857, '<td valign="top">Far out!   Looks good to me, sorry I don''t have anything contructive to add.</td>', 'Far out!   Looks good to me, sorry I don''t have anything contructive to add.', '2005-11-30 16:36:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1908364, 263248, 43681, '<td valign="top">Looks like a razor !</td>', 'Looks like a razor !', '2005-11-30 16:37:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1908367, 263335, 46586, '<td valign="top">Too bad it''s so small because I liked the idea...</td>', 'Too bad it''s so small because I liked the idea...', '2005-11-30 16:38:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1908373, 263619, 46586, '<td valign="top">I wish the colors were a bit more saturated and bright.</td>', 'I wish the colors were a bit more saturated and bright.', '2005-11-30 16:41:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1908384, 262251, 41337, '<td valign="top">mmkay</td>', 'mmkay', '2005-11-30 16:48:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1908393, 262951, 43681, '<td valign="top">Better if you cut cars above !</td>', 'Better if you cut cars above !', '2005-11-30 16:50:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1908394, 263335, 48717, '<td valign="top">Nice, wish it were a bit bigger.  Good detail and focus though.</td>', 'Nice, wish it were a bit bigger.  Good detail and focus though.', '2005-11-30 16:51:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1908401, 263188, 41337, '<td valign="top">Not to sound too harsh but this is just not interesting to look at. Also, the image is just not sharp although you''ve managed to oversharpen parts of it.</td>', 'Not to sound too harsh but this is just not interesting to look at. Also, the image is just not sharp although you''ve managed to oversharpen parts of it.', '2005-11-30 16:53:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1908405, 262976, 41794, '<td valign="top">Like the contrast options in this shot. As you stated - Beauty vs. blight, but also contrast in textures. Nicely composed, good light...bumping up.</td>', 'Like the contrast options in this shot. As you stated - Beauty vs. blight, but also contrast in textures. Nicely composed, good light...bumping up.', '2005-11-30 16:54:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1908410, 263532, 41794, '<td valign="top">Really like this shot. Good color contrast in front compared to the starker background. Maybe a little brighter would be good?</td>', 'Really like this shot. Good color contrast in front compared to the starker background. Maybe a little brighter would be good?', '2005-11-30 16:55:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1908412, 263716, 41794, '<td valign="top">Great perspective shot and love the "grainy" feel.</td>', 'Great perspective shot and love the "grainy" feel.', '2005-11-30 16:56:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1908463, 262795, 42981, '<td valign="top">very nice</td>', 'very nice', '2005-11-30 17:13:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1908469, 263473, 18073, '<td valign="top">I reckon you needed to work on the composition a liitle here.<br/> <br/>The chimney and smoke are nice as is the sky.  Perhaps you could have moved around the site a little to find a more interesting comp</td>', 'I reckon you needed to work on the composition a liitle here. The chimney and smoke are nice as is the sky.  Perhaps you could have moved around the site a little to find a more interesting comp', '2005-11-30 17:16:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1908471, 263628, 42981, '<td valign="top">is that real????<br/>nice though</td>', 'is that real????nice though', '2005-11-30 17:17:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1908482, 263729, 43774, '<td valign="top">Looks to have been taken with a long zoom, quality is not that great.</td>', 'Looks to have been taken with a long zoom, quality is not that great.', '2005-11-30 17:21:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1908489, 261477, 43774, '<td valign="top">I don''t think the shallow DOF works in this case.</td>', 'I don''t think the shallow DOF works in this case.', '2005-11-30 17:23:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1908492, 263362, 48545, '<td valign="top">Great colours and power, good luck</td>', 'Great colours and power, good luck', '2005-11-30 17:24:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1908494, 262309, 41743, '<td valign="top">Wow why isn''t it a smoke stack?, nice to see a picture of the tools of industry rather than the by-products of Industry, besides everyone loves an over sized tool!  don''t they?</td>', 'Wow why isn''t it a smoke stack?, nice to see a picture of the tools of industry rather than the by-products of Industry, besides everyone loves an over sized tool!  don''t they?', '2005-11-30 17:25:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1908497, 261915, 43774, '<td valign="top">I think this would be betterif you did not shoot directly into the sun. The light is too harsh.</td>', 'I think this would be betterif you did not shoot directly into the sun. The light is too harsh.', '2005-11-30 17:25:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1908500, 262971, 43774, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and choice of subject. But there is something odd about the focus and post processing.</td>', 'Nice composition and choice of subject. But there is something odd about the focus and post processing.', '2005-11-30 17:26:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1908504, 262036, 43774, '<td valign="top">Photo looks overexposed and washed out, a better exposure would have helped because those lines are interesting.</td>', 'Photo looks overexposed and washed out, a better exposure would have helped because those lines are interesting.', '2005-11-30 17:27:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1908505, 263365, 43774, '<td valign="top">Photo is too dark and focus seems off as well.</td>', 'Photo is too dark and focus seems off as well.', '2005-11-30 17:27:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1908509, 263463, 41743, '<td valign="top">Great, took me a while to work out, but then couldn''t help imagining someone wrestling with a pigeon against a car bonnet.! <br/>but it obviously a poor misguided bird but a very lucky photographer to spot the opportunity<br/>well done!</td>', 'Great, took me a while to work out, but then couldn''t help imagining someone wrestling with a pigeon against a car bonnet.! but it obviously a poor misguided bird but a very lucky photographer to spot the opportunitywell done!', '2005-11-30 17:29:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1908522, 263491, 39349, '<td valign="top">Not much to say other than beautifully done.</td>', 'Not much to say other than beautifully done.', '2005-11-30 17:35:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1908525, 262984, 39349, '<td valign="top">AMAZING! Great job.</td>', 'AMAZING! Great job.', '2005-11-30 17:35:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1908531, 262251, 43298, '<td valign="top">ummmmmmmmm............?</td>', 'ummmmmmmmm............?', '2005-11-30 17:38:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1908536, 263546, 45857, '<td valign="top">The distasteful rear end of industry, very journalistic.</td>', 'The distasteful rear end of industry, very journalistic.', '2005-11-30 17:40:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1908540, 262983, 45857, '<td valign="top">Nice crisp image of an all too familar sight.</td>', 'Nice crisp image of an all too familar sight.', '2005-11-30 17:42:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1908547, 262271, 48435, '<td valign="top">Beef up the contrast and you''ve got a great shot!</td>', 'Beef up the contrast and you''ve got a great shot!', '2005-11-30 17:44:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1908551, 263031, 48545, '<td valign="top">I was hoping to see a photo like this, great composition, sense of size and power</td>', 'I was hoping to see a photo like this, great composition, sense of size and power', '2005-11-30 17:45:59.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(1908566, 263462, 45857, '<td valign="top">Interesting approach to the topic, I like the dynamic aspect of the titile and shot.</td>', 'Interesting approach to the topic, I like the dynamic aspect of the titile and shot.', '2005-11-30 17:51:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1908570, 262757, 47096, '<td valign="top">Arresting photograph. Love the quality of the lighting and the way the people are silhouetted in the background. Also like the diagonal  created by the side of the ship. Great job!</td>', 'Arresting photograph. Love the quality of the lighting and the way the people are silhouetted in the background. Also like the diagonal  created by the side of the ship. Great job!', '2005-11-30 17:52:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1908573, 262976, 47096, '<td valign="top">Nice juxtaposition of beauty and industry.</td>', 'Nice juxtaposition of beauty and industry.', '2005-11-30 17:53:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1908578, 261959, 47096, '<td valign="top">Beautiful composition. I like the combination of horizontal and vertical elements in the photo.</td>', 'Beautiful composition. I like the combination of horizontal and vertical elements in the photo.', '2005-11-30 17:55:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1908589, 261679, 47096, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure how well this communicates the ''industrial'' theme, but it is a wonderful photograph. I like how graphic it is.</td>', 'I''m not sure how well this communicates the ''industrial'' theme, but it is a wonderful photograph. I like how graphic it is.', '2005-11-30 17:57:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1908590, 262220, 47096, '<td valign="top">Great use of DOF. Is that a railroad track in the foreground?</td>', 'Great use of DOF. Is that a railroad track in the foreground?', '2005-11-30 17:58:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1908595, 262543, 47096, '<td valign="top">Mysterious and interesting. Great job!</td>', 'Mysterious and interesting. Great job!', '2005-11-30 17:59:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1908605, 263736, 39850, '<td valign="top">6 - Nice colors, shapes and lighting.  Criticism; would like to see that lighting at the bottom of the tanks/silos(?) on the right incorporated/used more if possible.  Also seems it needs a slight nudge rotation up on the left, but difficult to tell at this sharp (but good) angle.  Like to see the colors in the tanks/silos even more vivid, again if possible.</td>', '6 - Nice colors, shapes and lighting.  Criticism; would like to see that lighting at the bottom of the tanks/silos(?) on the right incorporated/used more if possible.  Also seems it needs a slight nudge rotation up on the left, but difficult to tell at this sharp (but good) angle.  Like to see the colors in the tanks/silos even more vivid, again if possible.', '2005-11-30 18:04:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1908609, 263257, 39850, '<td valign="top">6 - Like the potential here and I am sure the size restrictions do not do this shot justice.  Criticism; seems slight rotation up on the left needed, or maybe it is the cropping.  Like to see more detail, or focus, somehow on the welder.  Just noticed the ''smoke'', so that, if possible (no idea how and may be camera/lens dependent) incorporated or ''highlighted'' more, may have made this even better in my opinion.  Good coloring.  Not sure on the frame.</td>', '6 - Like the potential here and I am sure the size restrictions do not do this shot justice.  Criticism; seems slight rotation up on the left needed, or maybe it is the cropping.  Like to see more detail, or focus, somehow on the welder.  Just noticed the ''smoke'', so that, if possible (no idea how and may be camera/lens dependent) incorporated or ''highlighted'' more, may have made this even better in my opinion.  Good coloring.  Not sure on the frame.', '2005-11-30 18:07:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1908618, 262394, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Good shot, good almost silhouette effect.  Criticism; difficult to tell, but seems it needs a slight nudge rotation up on the left, but the horizon in the distance seems level from what I can discern so not sure.  This definitely needs 640 height to help it.  The b/w(?) toning works well here, nice overall ''feel''.</td>', '7 - Good shot, good almost silhouette effect.  Criticism; difficult to tell, but seems it needs a slight nudge rotation up on the left, but the horizon in the distance seems level from what I can discern so not sure.  This definitely needs 640 height to help it.  The b/w(?) toning works well here, nice overall ''feel''.', '2005-11-30 18:10:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1908629, 262384, 39850, '<td valign="top">5 - Coloring is good.  Criticism; this looks like it has more potential than has been captured.  Depending on opportunity - but I think a more symmetrical or ''front on'' angle/perspective would have made this a better shot in my opinion, or else perhaps a different crop, not sure. edit:typo<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-12-07 07:32:45.</i></td>', '5 - Coloring is good.  Criticism; this looks like it has more potential than has been captured.  Depending on opportunity - but I think a more symmetrical or ''front on'' angle/perspective would have made this a better shot in my opinion, or else perhaps a different crop, not sure. edit:typo', '2005-11-30 18:12:05.000000', '2005-12-07 07:32:45.000000', 1),
(1908633, 263122, 39850, '<td valign="top">5 - Different, like the effect, good colors.  Criticism; needs straightening, or a different crop, to gain more symmetry in this type of shot in my opinion, even though I can see you have tried, but that left edge/wall puts this off balance too much.  Perhaps just a different perspective/angle, not sure.</td>', '5 - Different, like the effect, good colors.  Criticism; needs straightening, or a different crop, to gain more symmetry in this type of shot in my opinion, even though I can see you have tried, but that left edge/wall puts this off balance too much.  Perhaps just a different perspective/angle, not sure.', '2005-11-30 18:14:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1908636, 263300, 39850, '<td valign="top">6 - Good perspective.  Criticism; like to see an even sharper perspective - creating an ''ominous'' type of feel.  The colors are good, with the variations in white, perhaps this accentuated somehow, may have made this even better in my opinion.  The bottom left edge of the ''building'' slightly detracts, but minor.</td>', '6 - Good perspective.  Criticism; like to see an even sharper perspective - creating an ''ominous'' type of feel.  The colors are good, with the variations in white, perhaps this accentuated somehow, may have made this even better in my opinion.  The bottom left edge of the ''building'' slightly detracts, but minor.', '2005-11-30 18:17:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1908639, 263471, 39850, '<td valign="top">6 - Good perspective and ''view''.  Criticism; without the cars, and those ''billowing smoke clouds'' emphasized somehow, would have made this better in my opinion.</td>', '6 - Good perspective and ''view''.  Criticism; without the cars, and those ''billowing smoke clouds'' emphasized somehow, would have made this better in my opinion.', '2005-11-30 18:18:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1908657, 262402, 39850, '<td valign="top">6 - Like it.  Criticism; perhaps just a little more space either side of the can, and a slight rotation up on the left, may have made this better in my opinion.   It is obviously unused, and the ''filaments'' attached to it add an extra element to the feel of this, which have been captured in the sunlight(?).  Perhaps just a bit stronger colors, but difficult I imagine with contrast issues.</td>', '6 - Like it.  Criticism; perhaps just a little more space either side of the can, and a slight rotation up on the left, may have made this better in my opinion.   It is obviously unused, and the ''filaments'' attached to it add an extra element to the feel of this, which have been captured in the sunlight(?).  Perhaps just a bit stronger colors, but difficult I imagine with contrast issues.', '2005-11-30 18:25:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1908660, 262841, 39850, '<td valign="top">6 - Like the potential.  Criticism; in my opinion there is too much grain, whether it was intentional or not, not sure, either way, detracts from an already ''texturous'' enough shot in my opinion.  Like the perspective, but wonder if that roofing on the right detracts a little from the sharp perspective.  Like to see the focal point perhaps a little more to the fore.</td>', '6 - Like the potential.  Criticism; in my opinion there is too much grain, whether it was intentional or not, not sure, either way, detracts from an already ''texturous'' enough shot in my opinion.  Like the perspective, but wonder if that roofing on the right detracts a little from the sharp perspective.  Like to see the focal point perhaps a little more to the fore.', '2005-11-30 18:27:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1908666, 262971, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Like this and the colors together.  Criticism; don''t know how you did this under ''basic'', but seems like it is ''over'' burned.  A more subtle ''burn effect'', would have made this better in my opinion.  Too much detail is lost in the concrete(?) structure/silos/tanks/whatever.  Good angle/perspective.  Just those black areas seem too ''processed'' to me, hard to explain. edit:typo<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-12-07 07:27:37.</i></td>', '7 - Like this and the colors together.  Criticism; don''t know how you did this under ''basic'', but seems like it is ''over'' burned.  A more subtle ''burn effect'', would have made this better in my opinion.  Too much detail is lost in the concrete(?) structure/silos/tanks/whatever.  Good angle/perspective.  Just those black areas seem too ''processed'' to me, hard to explain. edit:typo', '2005-11-30 18:30:14.000000', '2005-12-07 07:27:37.000000', 1),
