(1908690, 261827, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Good shot, good symmetry.  Criticism; want to say I''d like to see the ''smoke'' more, but difficult at this angle/size.  I like the effect with the lower lights.  seems either a flaw or not sure, in the middle of the ''stack''/''tower'' but could be lights.  Overall the feel is good but seems just a little ''overprocessed'', detracting (albeit slightly) from the main subject, in my opinion.</td>', '7 - Good shot, good symmetry.  Criticism; want to say I''d like to see the ''smoke'' more, but difficult at this angle/size.  I like the effect with the lower lights.  seems either a flaw or not sure, in the middle of the ''stack''/''tower'' but could be lights.  Overall the feel is good but seems just a little ''overprocessed'', detracting (albeit slightly) from the main subject, in my opinion.', '2005-11-30 18:36:24.000000', NULL, 1),
