(1908753, 262220, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Great perspective/angle.  Good color.  Criticism; wish it were a fraction wider.  If the top of that left tower in the background were not cut off, would make this even better in my opinion.  Difficult to tell, but seems perhaps a fraction nudge rotation up on the right is needed, not sure.  Really like the detail and texture capture at the fore - even sharper still ''somehow'' would be good, but likely hard to get the background as it is so who knows.</td>', '7 - Great perspective/angle.  Good color.  Criticism; wish it were a fraction wider.  If the top of that left tower in the background were not cut off, would make this even better in my opinion.  Difficult to tell, but seems perhaps a fraction nudge rotation up on the right is needed, not sure.  Really like the detail and texture capture at the fore - even sharper still ''somehow'' would be good, but likely hard to get the background as it is so who knows.', '2005-11-30 18:51:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1908765, 262757, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Good shot, almost abstract.  Good coloring.  Criticism; difficult, but perhaps if the anchor were sharper, might have made this better in my opinion.  Like the silhouette effect of the workers.</td>', '7 - Good shot, almost abstract.  Good coloring.  Criticism; difficult, but perhaps if the anchor were sharper, might have made this better in my opinion.  Like the silhouette effect of the workers.', '2005-11-30 18:55:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1908775, 261763, 39850, '<td valign="top">5 - Mostly for the potential.  Like the sharp perspective angle.  Criticism; needs to be at least 640, in this case width.  Not an overt ''industrial'' type feel in the ship itself, but the anchor helps this.  Just needs to be bigger.  The anchor sharper too would have made this better in my opinion.  Perhaps a slightly different crop too, not sure.</td>', '5 - Mostly for the potential.  Like the sharp perspective angle.  Criticism; needs to be at least 640, in this case width.  Not an overt ''industrial'' type feel in the ship itself, but the anchor helps this.  Just needs to be bigger.  The anchor sharper too would have made this better in my opinion.  Perhaps a slightly different crop too, not sure.', '2005-11-30 18:59:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1908787, 263536, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Good concept and perspective.  Criticism; difficult, as you were likely going for such ''darkness'', but in my opinion a little more ''balance'', and/or color/toning and detail, would have made this even better.  The ''grain'' works, but perhaps if it were either enhanced to make it more dominant, or the whole shot softened, not sure, just seems to be hovering in the middle, yet still noticeable, if that makes sense. edit:typos<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-12-07 07:16:25.</i></td>', '7 - Good concept and perspective.  Criticism; difficult, as you were likely going for such ''darkness'', but in my opinion a little more ''balance'', and/or color/toning and detail, would have made this even better.  The ''grain'' works, but perhaps if it were either enhanced to make it more dominant, or the whole shot softened, not sure, just seems to be hovering in the middle, yet still noticeable, if that makes sense. edit:typos', '2005-11-30 19:03:01.000000', '2005-12-07 07:16:25.000000', 1),
(1908796, 263367, 39850, '<td valign="top">6 - Good coloring and use of lines and silhouetting.  Criticism; apologies if wrong, but seems this is ''tilted'' and needs a rotation up on the left, perhaps even only slightly.  Maybe without the cloud top right, might have given this an even more unusual and dramatic feel (especially the silhouette effect), not sure.  Those 5 extra pixels in width would also have helped this.</td>', '6 - Good coloring and use of lines and silhouetting.  Criticism; apologies if wrong, but seems this is ''tilted'' and needs a rotation up on the left, perhaps even only slightly.  Maybe without the cloud top right, might have given this an even more unusual and dramatic feel (especially the silhouette effect), not sure.  Those 5 extra pixels in width would also have helped this.', '2005-11-30 19:06:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1908805, 263715, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Nice colors and perspective.  Criticism; less trees in the fore and perhaps an even sharper perspective, and a slightly different crop at the fore, may have made this even better in my opinion.</td>', '7 - Nice colors and perspective.  Criticism; less trees in the fore and perhaps an even sharper perspective, and a slightly different crop at the fore, may have made this even better in my opinion.', '2005-11-30 19:08:34.000000', NULL, 1),
