(1908869, 263530, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Excellent perspective/angle/view.  Criticism; your title nearly ruined this for me - it seems ''forced'' and doesn''t suit/complement this shot in my opinion, in fact detracts from it.  Really like this shot, and if this view/idea is original, well done.</td>', '7 - Excellent perspective/angle/view.  Criticism; your title nearly ruined this for me - it seems ''forced'' and doesn''t suit/complement this shot in my opinion, in fact detracts from it.  Really like this shot, and if this view/idea is original, well done.', '2005-11-30 19:27:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1908884, 263596, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Very good, good coloring too.  Criticism; seems like it needs a nudge rotation up on the left - this looks like it is crooked, but apologies if wrong.  Coloring is good, and while has a slight ''grungy'' feel, like to see a little more contrast, and/or bolder colors, if possible.  Maybe a different cropping too, not sure.</td>', '7 - Very good, good coloring too.  Criticism; seems like it needs a nudge rotation up on the left - this looks like it is crooked, but apologies if wrong.  Coloring is good, and while has a slight ''grungy'' feel, like to see a little more contrast, and/or bolder colors, if possible.  Maybe a different cropping too, not sure.', '2005-11-30 19:30:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1908900, 263627, 48268, '<td valign="top">This isn''t really a comment, except that I really like this picture.  Where is this?</td>', 'This isn''t really a comment, except that I really like this picture.  Where is this?', '2005-11-30 19:37:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1908914, 263513, 40819, '<td valign="top">Excellent colors and completely in tune with the challenge. Very nice work.</td>', 'Excellent colors and completely in tune with the challenge. Very nice work.', '2005-11-30 19:43:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1908920, 263028, 26313, '<td valign="top">Your highlights seem a little blown out. Nice though. After the challenge I''d like to know where exactly this was shot from. My only day for shooting was Saturday, and it was snowing, so I figured I was better off getting in close than trying something like this, so I went for a five-hour walk down Burlington St.</td>', 'Your highlights seem a little blown out. Nice though. After the challenge I''d like to know where exactly this was shot from. My only day for shooting was Saturday, and it was snowing, so I figured I was better off getting in close than trying something like this, so I went for a five-hour walk down Burlington St.', '2005-11-30 19:44:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1908923, 262901, 40819, '<td valign="top">This is a good idea but the image is too dark and shot from too far away for anyone to get the meaning of industrial. Sorry but keep trying.</td>', 'This is a good idea but the image is too dark and shot from too far away for anyone to get the meaning of industrial. Sorry but keep trying.', '2005-11-30 19:45:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1908932, 262355, 40819, '<td valign="top">nope not my idea of industrial.</td>', 'nope not my idea of industrial.', '2005-11-30 19:46:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1908938, 263387, 26313, '<td valign="top">This is my kind of shot (in fact I think I have some very similar ones), but I think your composition could use a little work. It seems a little cluttered in the lower left, and the tree branch in the lower right is a little distracting.</td>', 'This is my kind of shot (in fact I think I have some very similar ones), but I think your composition could use a little work. It seems a little cluttered in the lower left, and the tree branch in the lower right is a little distracting.', '2005-11-30 19:49:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1908943, 263335, 39850, '<td valign="top">3 - Good potential.  Criticism; needs at least 640, in this case width, but this ''composition'' may lend itself to 640 x 640.  Hard to discern at this size, but seems the focus is sharpest on the larger cog/gear on the right, so a shift in focus might have also helped this.</td>', '3 - Good potential.  Criticism; needs at least 640, in this case width, but this ''composition'' may lend itself to 640 x 640.  Hard to discern at this size, but seems the focus is sharpest on the larger cog/gear on the right, so a shift in focus might have also helped this.', '2005-11-30 19:51:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1908949, 263256, 39850, '<td valign="top">6 - Nice.  Criticism; sun is a little distracting (dominant) on the left.  The silhouette effect is good.  Perhaps a slightly tighter crop at the bottom, not sure, as does ''work'' like it is.  Those 12 extra pixels in width would have helped this.  Color is nice.  Not sure on the frame, perhaps just a fraction too thick, especially at this size, in my opinion.</td>', '6 - Nice.  Criticism; sun is a little distracting (dominant) on the left.  The silhouette effect is good.  Perhaps a slightly tighter crop at the bottom, not sure, as does ''work'' like it is.  Those 12 extra pixels in width would have helped this.  Color is nice.  Not sure on the frame, perhaps just a fraction too thick, especially at this size, in my opinion.', '2005-11-30 19:57:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1908952, 262053, 4610, '<td valign="top">Very sharp and crisp picture, the lights are not blown. Great 8</td>', 'Very sharp and crisp picture, the lights are not blown. Great 8', '2005-11-30 20:00:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1908953, 262432, 26313, '<td valign="top">Focus seems off, need to see more surface detail. Feels like it is cropped a little close on the right, and I think a little more rotation (counter clockwise) would help composition.</td>', 'Focus seems off, need to see more surface detail. Feels like it is cropped a little close on the right, and I think a little more rotation (counter clockwise) would help composition.', '2005-11-30 20:00:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1908954, 263532, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Very nice, good use of color.  Criticism; difficult as, as much as I like the fore ''grass'' texture and color effect, just think if it were ''competing'' less (especially for this Challenge) would make this even better in my opinion.  Also difficult to tell, but seems the sharpest focus is on the mountain rather than the ''factory'' (apologies if wrong there), so a shift in focus might have also made this better.  An overall ''contrasting'' type of feel to this shot, given the ''environment''.</td>', '8 - Very nice, good use of color.  Criticism; difficult as, as much as I like the fore ''grass'' texture and color effect, just think if it were ''competing'' less (especially for this Challenge) would make this even better in my opinion.  Also difficult to tell, but seems the sharpest focus is on the mountain rather than the ''factory'' (apologies if wrong there), so a shift in focus might have also made this better.  An overall ''contrasting'' type of feel to this shot, given the ''environment''.', '2005-11-30 20:02:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1908956, 263463, 4610, '<td valign="top">Ouch, very interesting picture</td>', 'Ouch, very interesting picture', '2005-11-30 20:03:36.000000', NULL, 1),
