(1908966, 262251, 37719, '<td valign="top">You know, I like this photo, but not for this challenge.  The requirements were industrial, not nude.  You would never see a nude person working in an industrial setting.</td>', 'You know, I like this photo, but not for this challenge.  The requirements were industrial, not nude.  You would never see a nude person working in an industrial setting.', '2005-11-30 20:07:40.000000', NULL, 1),
