(1909062, 263041, 43463, '<td valign="top">Love the scenery in this shot. The silhouettes of all the figures (the boats, the shipyard in the background, the Statue of Liberty) gives this photo a timeless quality - you cannot quite identify when the shot was taken 20''s, 30''s, 40''s ---The senna coloring gives it an "aged look" which also plays into a feel of nostalgia. Although I wonder if B&amp;W would have been better to give it a feel of watching one of those old B&amp;W classic movies.</td>', 'Love the scenery in this shot. The silhouettes of all the figures (the boats, the shipyard in the background, the Statue of Liberty) gives this photo a timeless quality - you cannot quite identify when the shot was taken 20''s, 30''s, 40''s ---The senna coloring gives it an "aged look" which also plays into a feel of nostalgia. Although I wonder if B&W would have been better to give it a feel of watching one of those old B&W classic movies.', '2005-11-30 20:36:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1909065, 263525, 41450, '<td valign="top">nice atmosphere and colors</td>', 'nice atmosphere and colors', '2005-11-30 20:37:40.000000', NULL, 1),
