(1909139, 262118, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Good shot, good colors, good perspective.  Criticism; difficult, maybe more detail at the front of the train/locomotive, especially in the dark/black areas, may have made this better in my opinion.  Slight crop adjustment too, especially at the top right, there is ''something'' there.  Like to see the colors even more vivid, but difficult, especially with the resulting contrast issues. edit:typo<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-12-07 06:57:19.</i></td>', '8 - Good shot, good colors, good perspective.  Criticism; difficult, maybe more detail at the front of the train/locomotive, especially in the dark/black areas, may have made this better in my opinion.  Slight crop adjustment too, especially at the top right, there is ''something'' there.  Like to see the colors even more vivid, but difficult, especially with the resulting contrast issues. edit:typo', '2005-11-30 20:54:15.000000', '2005-12-07 06:57:19.000000', 1),
