(1910712, 262919, 38666, '<td valign="top">I had to score it lower than I would have liked. My first reponse is actually espionage or security or paranoia, and it takes a while going down the list of adjectives for ''ME'' to get to industrial.  It''s a brilliant photo otherwise, and in another category I''d give it a 9 or 10.</td>', 'I had to score it lower than I would have liked. My first reponse is actually espionage or security or paranoia, and it takes a while going down the list of adjectives for ''ME'' to get to industrial.  It''s a brilliant photo otherwise, and in another category I''d give it a 9 or 10.', '2005-12-01 01:57:57.000000', NULL, 1),
