(1910790, 263545, 38666, '<td valign="top">This one says transportation to me, first and foremost. Then architecture. Then maybe industrial. Nice composition though, and the colours are rich and punchy, although I would    much prefer that the ghosted lights of the train (or whatever it is), streaked right through the photo, end to end. 7 out of 10.</td>', 'This one says transportation to me, first and foremost. Then architecture. Then maybe industrial. Nice composition though, and the colours are rich and punchy, although I would    much prefer that the ghosted lights of the train (or whatever it is), streaked right through the photo, end to end. 7 out of 10.', '2005-12-01 02:18:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1910800, 262320, 38666, '<td valign="top">Great angle! I only wish the primary reflection were as interesting as the smaller secondary one. "A" for effort, but only 7/10, sorry.</td>', 'Great angle! I only wish the primary reflection were as interesting as the smaller secondary one. "A" for effort, but only 7/10, sorry.', '2005-12-01 02:21:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1910823, 262543, 38666, '<td valign="top">I''d have given this a 10 in some other category, but it doesn''t work as an industrial for me., ''cept for the brick and bars. It''s the girl looking into the lights that is the central statement of this photo, and though it says a lot of different things to me, industrial isn''t one of them<br/>I love it . 7/10. Sorry, hope to be helpful.</td>', 'I''d have given this a 10 in some other category, but it doesn''t work as an industrial for me., ''cept for the brick and bars. It''s the girl looking into the lights that is the central statement of this photo, and though it says a lot of different things to me, industrial isn''t one of themI love it . 7/10. Sorry, hope to be helpful.', '2005-12-01 02:28:07.000000', NULL, 1),
