(1911223, 263362, 30669, '<td valign="top">Great shot  9</td>', 'Great shot  9', '2005-12-01 05:33:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1911224, 263362, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Good effect and lighting.  Criticism; apologies if I am wrong, but this seems like it needs rotation/straightening.  Toning is good, but it just seems ''tilted''.  2nd look - looks like it might have a pier/jetty/causeway(?) going out into water, but it is barely discernable, still, looks slightly ''tilted''.</td>', '7 - Good effect and lighting.  Criticism; apologies if I am wrong, but this seems like it needs rotation/straightening.  Toning is good, but it just seems ''tilted''.  2nd look - looks like it might have a pier/jetty/causeway(?) going out into water, but it is barely discernable, still, looks slightly ''tilted''.', '2005-12-01 05:34:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1911231, 263547, 39850, '<td valign="top">6 - Like this.  Criticism; in my opinion, a tighter zoom/crop (if possible), aiming for the ''smoke/steam clouds'' to really dominate this shot, would have made it even better in my opinion.  The colors are also nice, but would like to see them a bit more vivid, perhaps it is the lights that are competing with them too much, not sure.</td>', '6 - Like this.  Criticism; in my opinion, a tighter zoom/crop (if possible), aiming for the ''smoke/steam clouds'' to really dominate this shot, would have made it even better in my opinion.  The colors are also nice, but would like to see them a bit more vivid, perhaps it is the lights that are competing with them too much, not sure.', '2005-12-01 05:39:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1911235, 262053, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Very nice, looks futuristic.  I''m sure the size restrictions don''t do this justice.  Criticism; difficult to tell, but the ''level'' seems a fraction out, apologies if wrong (makes 0 difference to my score).  I want to suggest perhaps more space on the right, but this works well, especially with the ''belts'' or roads, whatever they are, in symmetry like this, so who knows.  Seems to be ''something'' top right too, no idea what.  Perhaps if you''d gone for more height incorporation here might have helped this in this medium, but you''d lose the ''wide aspect'' you''ve obviously gone for so, difficult. 2nd look, I think this is ''level'', just the ground variations ''deceive the eye'', especially at this size.</td>', '7 - Very nice, looks futuristic.  I''m sure the size restrictions don''t do this justice.  Criticism; difficult to tell, but the ''level'' seems a fraction out, apologies if wrong (makes 0 difference to my score).  I want to suggest perhaps more space on the right, but this works well, especially with the ''belts'' or roads, whatever they are, in symmetry like this, so who knows.  Seems to be ''something'' top right too, no idea what.  Perhaps if you''d gone for more height incorporation here might have helped this in this medium, but you''d lose the ''wide aspect'' you''ve obviously gone for so, difficult. 2nd look, I think this is ''level'', just the ground variations ''deceive the eye'', especially at this size.', '2005-12-01 05:44:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1911336, 262770, 30669, '<td valign="top">Great shot</td>', 'Great shot', '2005-12-01 06:46:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1911343, 262795, 30669, '<td valign="top">A great shot -one of the best -10</td>', 'A great shot -one of the best -10', '2005-12-01 06:48:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1911373, 263596, 28029, '<td valign="top">Bad color, nice composition.</td>', 'Bad color, nice composition.', '2005-12-01 06:59:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1911452, 263330, 8624, '<td valign="top">interesting shot of some unique materials. meets the challenge well. the colors look a little oversaturated to me and I wish the bottom left hole wasn''t cropped off so much.</td>', 'interesting shot of some unique materials. meets the challenge well. the colors look a little oversaturated to me and I wish the bottom left hole wasn''t cropped off so much.', '2005-12-01 07:24:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1911454, 263070, 8624, '<td valign="top">good leading lines and repetition of pattern.</td>', 'good leading lines and repetition of pattern.', '2005-12-01 07:25:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1911472, 263628, 39664, '<td valign="top">This looks very "War of the Worlds"!</td>', 'This looks very "War of the Worlds"!', '2005-12-01 07:38:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1911476, 263028, 48487, '<td valign="top">I would have cropped off the houses in the foreground.  I think they draw the eyed down and away from the scene.  Other than that, a great shot.  I like the contrast of the dark steel plant and the light plume.</td>', 'I would have cropped off the houses in the foreground.  I think they draw the eyed down and away from the scene.  Other than that, a great shot.  I like the contrast of the dark steel plant and the light plume.', '2005-12-01 07:39:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1911478, 262023, 8624, '<td valign="top">excellent use of perspective. great tones and lines.</td>', 'excellent use of perspective. great tones and lines.', '2005-12-01 07:40:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1911479, 263028, 39664, '<td valign="top">There is so much to take in.  There is a brightness to some parts that the midtones seem a bit harsh then there are other parts that seem soft, almost too blurry.  I don''t really like how much you tried to cram into this photograph, making it too busy.</td>', 'There is so much to take in.  There is a brightness to some parts that the midtones seem a bit harsh then there are other parts that seem soft, almost too blurry.  I don''t really like how much you tried to cram into this photograph, making it too busy.', '2005-12-01 07:41:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1911521, 263287, 47294, '<td valign="top">Your ISo seems a little high although I understand what you were going for here - Nice photo :)</td>', 'Your ISo seems a little high although I understand what you were going for here - Nice photo :)', '2005-12-01 08:02:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1911523, 262320, 47294, '<td valign="top">Clever!</td>', 'Clever!', '2005-12-01 08:02:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1911526, 263501, 47294, '<td valign="top">Very nice light, well done here :)</td>', 'Very nice light, well done here :)', '2005-12-01 08:04:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1911529, 263565, 47294, '<td valign="top">Very VERY clever - Well done!!!</td>', 'Very VERY clever - Well done!!!', '2005-12-01 08:06:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1911530, 263555, 47294, '<td valign="top">A little too dark IMO.</td>', 'A little too dark IMO.', '2005-12-01 08:07:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1911532, 263330, 47294, '<td valign="top">Great colours!  Maybe a little tightly cropped.</td>', 'Great colours!  Maybe a little tightly cropped.', '2005-12-01 08:08:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1911535, 261519, 47294, '<td valign="top">I LOVE it!</td>', 'I LOVE it!', '2005-12-01 08:09:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1911574, 262951, 45857, '<td valign="top">I think this would have been much stronger if you had centered more on the high tension towers, the cars and street are just clutter.</td>', 'I think this would have been much stronger if you had centered more on the high tension towers, the cars and street are just clutter.', '2005-12-01 08:26:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1911598, 262063, 42514, '<td valign="top">I think this picture would have been great should you managed to change it to B&amp;W.</td>', 'I think this picture would have been great should you managed to change it to B&W.', '2005-12-01 08:32:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1911604, 261477, 45857, '<td valign="top">Intriguing title, but the image seems to say OOF needles. Motion blur would have been much better. Also if if there had been more colorful threads, a lot of them just get lost in the silver.</td>', 'Intriguing title, but the image seems to say OOF needles. Motion blur would have been much better. Also if if there had been more colorful threads, a lot of them just get lost in the silver.', '2005-12-01 08:34:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1911605, 263501, 42514, '<td valign="top">Love the pic mate, Excellent job!!!</td>', 'Love the pic mate, Excellent job!!!', '2005-12-01 08:34:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1911614, 262320, 45857, '<td valign="top">I like the mirrors and also the graphic outlines in the equipment, you make it seem almost hand drawn.</td>', 'I like the mirrors and also the graphic outlines in the equipment, you make it seem almost hand drawn.', '2005-12-01 08:37:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1911622, 262053, 30669, '<td valign="top">Nice shot</td>', 'Nice shot', '2005-12-01 08:39:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1911627, 263028, 45857, '<td valign="top">hmm... Hamilton?  Anyhow, good industrial landscape.</td>', 'hmm... Hamilton?  Anyhow, good industrial landscape.', '2005-12-01 08:40:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1911630, 262929, 30669, '<td valign="top">Very Nice</td>', 'Very Nice', '2005-12-01 08:41:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1911639, 262558, 45857, '<td valign="top">Of course I smell it, I live 5 miles from Eastman Chemical.... :)<br/>I love the acerbic colors, they work so well with your topic.</td>', 'Of course I smell it, I live 5 miles from Eastman Chemical.... :)I love the acerbic colors, they work so well with your topic.', '2005-12-01 08:45:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1911652, 262222, 45857, '<td valign="top">This too simplistic and understated. I think it would have been better closer to your subject, or even panned right a bit, the building over there seem more interesting than to the left. Also your horizion is tilted enough to feel uncomfortable.</td>', 'This too simplistic and understated. I think it would have been better closer to your subject, or even panned right a bit, the building over there seem more interesting than to the left. Also your horizion is tilted enough to feel uncomfortable.', '2005-12-01 08:50:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1911658, 263732, 45857, '<td valign="top">This is a nice stark image, I like the play of shadows on the foreground.</td>', 'This is a nice stark image, I like the play of shadows on the foreground.', '2005-12-01 08:53:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1911665, 263642, 45857, '<td valign="top">Ah, social commentary   :)<br/>I like the bold statement of the factory against the dark sky, and nicely composed.</td>', 'Ah, social commentary   :)I like the bold statement of the factory against the dark sky, and nicely composed.', '2005-12-01 08:57:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1911684, 263565, 45857, '<td valign="top">Not without a washer!<br/>You certain got down to nuts and bolts on this one.  A couple things: I would have liked more sense of direction to the composition, perhaps if you had rotated the bolt to point more at the nut. (hope that''s clear) Secondly, I wonder if there a way to achieve a bifocal effect, I''m thinking in terms of a split lens or a second lens between the camera and the subject.</td>', 'Not without a washer!You certain got down to nuts and bolts on this one.  A couple things: I would have liked more sense of direction to the composition, perhaps if you had rotated the bolt to point more at the nut. (hope that''s clear) Secondly, I wonder if there a way to achieve a bifocal effect, I''m thinking in terms of a split lens or a second lens between the camera and the subject.', '2005-12-01 09:06:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1911697, 262067, 45857, '<td valign="top">Good industrial grunge, with an urban feel.</td>', 'Good industrial grunge, with an urban feel.', '2005-12-01 09:11:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1911708, 262859, 45857, '<td valign="top">Dirty, distgustingly smelly, great subject for B&amp;W.</td>', 'Dirty, distgustingly smelly, great subject for B&W.', '2005-12-01 09:13:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1911709, 263248, 40819, '<td valign="top">This is a wonderful shot. I used B&amp;W for my entry as well and your symmetry is amazingly perfect.</td>', 'This is a wonderful shot. I used B&W for my entry as well and your symmetry is amazingly perfect.', '2005-12-01 09:14:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1911723, 263566, 45857, '<td valign="top">Stark Industries<br/>Breathing air compressors manufactured in Houston since 1969.   :)<br/>Love the lines and patterns, bold yellow.</td>', 'Stark IndustriesBreathing air compressors manufactured in Houston since 1969.   :)Love the lines and patterns, bold yellow.', '2005-12-01 09:19:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1911731, 262034, 45857, '<td valign="top">Certainly know your history. Your image makes a great statement.</td>', 'Certainly know your history. Your image makes a great statement.', '2005-12-01 09:21:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1911742, 263046, 45857, '<td valign="top">The bits and pieces of industry.     ;)<br/>Good macro work, like the green here, good choice for industrial.</td>', 'The bits and pieces of industry.     ;)Good macro work, like the green here, good choice for industrial.', '2005-12-01 09:24:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1911756, 263499, 45857, '<td valign="top">I wonder why this seems to have a surreal ''twisted'' appearance</td>', 'I wonder why this seems to have a surreal ''twisted'' appearance', '2005-12-01 09:27:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1911761, 262492, 44611, '<td valign="top">There''s a definite UFO in this shot!  Have the aliens landed near you!  Neat composition, perhaps a bit fuzzy on the focus, overall a fair shot.</td>', 'There''s a definite UFO in this shot!  Have the aliens landed near you!  Neat composition, perhaps a bit fuzzy on the focus, overall a fair shot.', '2005-12-01 09:28:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1911777, 262976, 44611, '<td valign="top">Fabulous juxtapositioning of nature against ugly, abandoned  buildings.  Composition and light are good - perhaps cropping could have been a bit tighter - there is quite a lot of distraction on the left side.  Great shot though and definitely a high scorer in my book.</td>', 'Fabulous juxtapositioning of nature against ugly, abandoned  buildings.  Composition and light are good - perhaps cropping could have been a bit tighter - there is quite a lot of distraction on the left side.  Great shot though and definitely a high scorer in my book.', '2005-12-01 09:33:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1911782, 263596, 44611, '<td valign="top">Well seen, well composed, well captured.  An impressive interpretation of the theme.  Definitely one of my top scores.</td>', 'Well seen, well composed, well captured.  An impressive interpretation of the theme.  Definitely one of my top scores.', '2005-12-01 09:33:55.000000', NULL, 1),
