(1912983, 263726, 45857, '<td valign="top">Minimalisticly intense, just enough to make your statement.<br/>Wow, 13 pt stars!</td>', 'Minimalisticly intense, just enough to make your statement.Wow, 13 pt stars!', '2005-12-01 14:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
