(1913087, 261490, 739, '<td valign="top">Great shot.  You must have picked the perfect time of day.  Love how the sky transitions from white to blue..</td>', 'Great shot.  You must have picked the perfect time of day.  Love how the sky transitions from white to blue..', '2005-12-01 14:50:27.000000', NULL, 1),
