(1913120, 263463, 16950, '<td valign="top">Not sure I get this, too abstract for me I guess.  How is this industrial?</td>', 'Not sure I get this, too abstract for me I guess.  How is this industrial?', '2005-12-01 14:55:16.000000', NULL, 1),
