(1913657, 263041, 21072, '<td valign="top">The photo really makes an impact when combined with the title - it makes you think about the consequences of our actions and whether they are worth it.</td>', 'The photo really makes an impact when combined with the title - it makes you think about the consequences of our actions and whether they are worth it.', '2005-12-01 17:46:43.000000', NULL, 1),
