(1922733, 262770, 44058, '<td valign="top">I really love this smoke that comes out of these chimneys.  Added to the lights of the town.  I love the night.  10 from me.</td>', 'I really love this smoke that comes out of these chimneys.  Added to the lights of the town.  I love the night.  10 from me.', '2005-12-05 02:17:54.000000', NULL, 1),
