(1923790, 263536, 24642, '<td valign="top">I like the composition here and the square format works well.</td>', 'I like the composition here and the square format works well.', '2005-12-05 12:26:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1923796, 263499, 24642, '<td valign="top">I like the way this building resembles a church.  The reflection of the red lights is very slick.</td>', 'I like the way this building resembles a church.  The reflection of the red lights is very slick.', '2005-12-05 12:28:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1923807, 263596, 48717, '<td valign="top">There is something so simple about this one, that causes me to like it a lot.  It is a step away from the forboding factories plumming smoke, but is still very much industrial.  Love the symmetry.</td>', 'There is something so simple about this one, that causes me to like it a lot.  It is a step away from the forboding factories plumming smoke, but is still very much industrial.  Love the symmetry.', '2005-12-05 12:30:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1923809, 263628, 24642, '<td valign="top">A very balanced and interesting composition.  The subject is fantastic and works very well in the dramatic lighting.  One of the best in the challenge.</td>', 'A very balanced and interesting composition.  The subject is fantastic and works very well in the dramatic lighting.  One of the best in the challenge.', '2005-12-05 12:30:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1923829, 262861, 48717, '<td valign="top">Cute pic, good lighting and setup.  Her face needs to be more  in focus.</td>', 'Cute pic, good lighting and setup.  Her face needs to be more  in focus.', '2005-12-05 12:34:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1923850, 262978, 48717, '<td valign="top">This has potential to be a really cool shot,  you should have tried to get closer, if closer was not possible, at least in front of the trees or more zoom on the factory.  I like the long plume of smoke in front of the clear sky.</td>', 'This has potential to be a really cool shot,  you should have tried to get closer, if closer was not possible, at least in front of the trees or more zoom on the factory.  I like the long plume of smoke in front of the clear sky.', '2005-12-05 12:40:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1923963, 262991, 48717, '<td valign="top">This could be a really nice nightscape, but the far side of town is too washed out.  I think you left the  shutter open too long.   This side of town looks better.  If it was hard to get both perfect, maybe a choice should be made to pick one area or the other.</td>', 'This could be a really nice nightscape, but the far side of town is too washed out.  I think you left the  shutter open too long.   This side of town looks better.  If it was hard to get both perfect, maybe a choice should be made to pick one area or the other.', '2005-12-05 13:00:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1923978, 262984, 48717, '<td valign="top">Love this, it is one of my tops.   Color, focus, exposure  and composition...perfect.</td>', 'Love this, it is one of my tops.   Color, focus, exposure  and composition...perfect.', '2005-12-05 13:04:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1923999, 263244, 17498, '<td valign="top">Exquisite! I''m sure the owner''s of this manufacturing plant never thought look so utterly captivating! Sepia? treatment is just perfect...Hope it''s a winner. If not, you still deserve a thousand pats on the back for this one!</td>', 'Exquisite! I''m sure the owner''s of this manufacturing plant never thought look so utterly captivating! Sepia? treatment is just perfect...Hope it''s a winner. If not, you still deserve a thousand pats on the back for this one!', '2005-12-05 13:09:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1924014, 262929, 17498, '<td valign="top">Fabulous shot! Is this really here on earth? Don''t know if that which the image represents is environmentlly safe, but it''s great on the eyes! Thanks!</td>', 'Fabulous shot! Is this really here on earth? Don''t know if that which the image represents is environmentlly safe, but it''s great on the eyes! Thanks!', '2005-12-05 13:14:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1924099, 263532, 18552, '<td valign="top">This is a nice picture for the challenge. You have really made industry look pretty!</td>', 'This is a nice picture for the challenge. You have really made industry look pretty!', '2005-12-05 13:40:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1924113, 263243, 18552, '<td valign="top">Very nicely taken picture. The light is just right on the shiny metal things - very hard to do. Great job.</td>', 'Very nicely taken picture. The light is just right on the shiny metal things - very hard to do. Great job.', '2005-12-05 13:43:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1924133, 262221, 18552, '<td valign="top">The stacks on the left look great but for some reason the stacks on the right have jaggies on the long sige. The border is also a bit wide and overwhelms the picture to some degree. It is a great picture for the challenge.</td>', 'The stacks on the left look great but for some reason the stacks on the right have jaggies on the long sige. The border is also a bit wide and overwhelms the picture to some degree. It is a great picture for the challenge.', '2005-12-05 13:50:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1924135, 263628, 18552, '<td valign="top">Very nice composition.</td>', 'Very nice composition.', '2005-12-05 13:51:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1924137, 262079, 18552, '<td valign="top">Very nice picture for the challenge. I really like the feeling it gives me.</td>', 'Very nice picture for the challenge. I really like the feeling it gives me.', '2005-12-05 13:52:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1924142, 262795, 18552, '<td valign="top">Wow, this is lovely. You have made industrial look beautiful. The reflection in the water really adds to your picture. This should be one of the ribbons!</td>', 'Wow, this is lovely. You have made industrial look beautiful. The reflection in the water really adds to your picture. This should be one of the ribbons!', '2005-12-05 13:54:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1924156, 262606, 18552, '<td valign="top">This really does have a gritty, industrial feel to it. To me, the compostion would have been inproved if the stack would have been on the right third line rather than almost in the middle. Also, the wires look very jaggy - they could have been this way but it kind of looks like it comes from the compression in resizing.</td>', 'This really does have a gritty, industrial feel to it. To me, the compostion would have been inproved if the stack would have been on the right third line rather than almost in the middle. Also, the wires look very jaggy - they could have been this way but it kind of looks like it comes from the compression in resizing.', '2005-12-05 13:59:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1924174, 263759, 18552, '<td valign="top">This has a nice industrial feel to it. To me, it needs a bit more contrast and less of the blank stuff in the foreground. I really like the one lighted window - it gives a kind of Thomas Kincade "cottagey" feel to this industrial scene. It is very appealing.</td>', 'This has a nice industrial feel to it. To me, it needs a bit more contrast and less of the blank stuff in the foreground. I really like the one lighted window - it gives a kind of Thomas Kincade "cottagey" feel to this industrial scene. It is very appealing.', '2005-12-05 14:02:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1924178, 262223, 18552, '<td valign="top">Very nice composition!</td>', 'Very nice composition!', '2005-12-05 14:03:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1924182, 261477, 18552, '<td valign="top">This really does suit the challenge and has a great "industrial" feel to it. My eyes just keep wishing there was more in focus than one needle. If more was in focus it would be more visually appealing to me.</td>', 'This really does suit the challenge and has a great "industrial" feel to it. My eyes just keep wishing there was more in focus than one needle. If more was in focus it would be more visually appealing to me.', '2005-12-05 14:04:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1924187, 263498, 18552, '<td valign="top">This is a very good picture for the challenge - it really has a great industrial feel to it. To me, the composition would have been improved by including more of the stack. Right now the crop puts the end of the stack at the half mark of the picture - if more of the stack were included so it ended at the top 1/3 it would have been more visually appealing.</td>', 'This is a very good picture for the challenge - it really has a great industrial feel to it. To me, the composition would have been improved by including more of the stack. Right now the crop puts the end of the stack at the half mark of the picture - if more of the stack were included so it ended at the top 1/3 it would have been more visually appealing.', '2005-12-05 14:04:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1924200, 263355, 18552, '<td valign="top">Nicely taken photograph. It is very well composed. I find myself strangely drawn to it.</td>', 'Nicely taken photograph. It is very well composed. I find myself strangely drawn to it.', '2005-12-05 14:06:23.000000', NULL, 1),
