(1924476, 261445, 31133, '<td valign="top">This could be improved (in my cpinion) by rotating the whole image clockwise a couple of degrees. Beautiful orange  and blue colors in the sky. Wonder how it would be with the contrast upped a bit.</td>', 'This could be improved (in my cpinion) by rotating the whole image clockwise a couple of degrees. Beautiful orange  and blue colors in the sky. Wonder how it would be with the contrast upped a bit.', '2005-12-05 15:28:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1924481, 262492, 31133, '<td valign="top">I can''t figure out what that is in the sky - must be the moon, a plane, or a star, but it doesn''t look like any of those to me. Good sky otherwise - love the rich blue as well as the placement of the tower in the frame with the smoke to the left. The light in the lower right is pretty distracting.</td>', 'I can''t figure out what that is in the sky - must be the moon, a plane, or a star, but it doesn''t look like any of those to me. Good sky otherwise - love the rich blue as well as the placement of the tower in the frame with the smoke to the left. The light in the lower right is pretty distracting.', '2005-12-05 15:30:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1924488, 262983, 31133, '<td valign="top">Beautiful post processing with the duotone (and nice composition from the beginning).  Not sure if this is the case or not, but it looks a little neat-imaged. I''d like to see a tiny bit of grit, but maybe that''s not what you were going for here.</td>', 'Beautiful post processing with the duotone (and nice composition from the beginning).  Not sure if this is the case or not, but it looks a little neat-imaged. I''d like to see a tiny bit of grit, but maybe that''s not what you were going for here.', '2005-12-05 15:33:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1924495, 263566, 31133, '<td valign="top">Powerful! One petty nitpick is the big thing in the upper left of the frame, but I can see that it would''ve been tough to get this angle and still manage to get that thing out of the frame.</td>', 'Powerful! One petty nitpick is the big thing in the upper left of the frame, but I can see that it would''ve been tough to get this angle and still manage to get that thing out of the frame.', '2005-12-05 15:35:20.000000', NULL, 1),
