(1929665, 263591, 39850, '<td valign="top">3 - Good potential.  Criticism; needs to be at least 640 on one side, in this case height.  More context and perhaps even ''straightening'', would have made this better in my opinion.  Like the toning, works well.</td>', '3 - Good potential.  Criticism; needs to be at least 640 on one side, in this case height.  More context and perhaps even ''straightening'', would have made this better in my opinion.  Like the toning, works well.', '2005-12-06 23:47:30.000000', NULL, 1),
