(1929676, 263188, 46091, '<td valign="top">focus?</td>', 'focus?', '2005-12-06 23:49:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1929685, 263244, 39850, '<td valign="top">9 - Ohh - very good.  Criticism; ahh, not much, maybe a little more space to the left if possible, may have made this even better.  Really like the lighting and composition and fore ''silhouette'' with the grass.  Another where the size wouldn''t do it justice, but that''s part of the game.  I think it is just the shadowing on the water(?) on the left, but seems this might need the slightest fraction nudge rotation up on the left, but I think it is just the shadow/whatever - apologies if wrong.  Great shot and ''effect(s)''.   Up to 9 from 8.</td>', '9 - Ohh - very good.  Criticism; ahh, not much, maybe a little more space to the left if possible, may have made this even better.  Really like the lighting and composition and fore ''silhouette'' with the grass.  Another where the size wouldn''t do it justice, but that''s part of the game.  I think it is just the shadowing on the water(?) on the left, but seems this might need the slightest fraction nudge rotation up on the left, but I think it is just the shadow/whatever - apologies if wrong.  Great shot and ''effect(s)''.   Up to 9 from 8.', '2005-12-06 23:51:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1929690, 261959, 39850, '<td valign="top">9 - Excellent.  Criticism; even though I''m assuming you''ve gone for the ''horizontal framing'' on purpose, I think 640 height too would make this even better, especially in this restrictive medium.  Good colors, shadowing.  Title is a little lost on me but doesn''t seem to be a ''forced one'' so minor.  Perhaps just a little more detail, especially in the steel framing, but again, likely is but not discernable at this size.  Up to 9 from 8.</td>', '9 - Excellent.  Criticism; even though I''m assuming you''ve gone for the ''horizontal framing'' on purpose, I think 640 height too would make this even better, especially in this restrictive medium.  Good colors, shadowing.  Title is a little lost on me but doesn''t seem to be a ''forced one'' so minor.  Perhaps just a little more detail, especially in the steel framing, but again, likely is but not discernable at this size.  Up to 9 from 8.', '2005-12-06 23:53:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1929698, 261627, 39850, '<td valign="top">9 - Very good.  You made me clean my monitor twice until I saw your title.  Criticism; not much, perhaps a bit more detail/sharper focus on one of those pipes, especially that dominant ''overhanging'' one (but then you''d likely lose your ''night sky effect'' so who knows) may have made this even better in my opinion.  Perhaps a slightly different crop, trying to gain more ''balance'', but again with the sky issues so who knows.  Nice overall ''feel'', like to see the ''rust'' even more vivid as well.  Possibly even a touch more ''darkness'' somewhere, especially given your (good and apt) title.  Up to 9 from 8.</td>', '9 - Very good.  You made me clean my monitor twice until I saw your title.  Criticism; not much, perhaps a bit more detail/sharper focus on one of those pipes, especially that dominant ''overhanging'' one (but then you''d likely lose your ''night sky effect'' so who knows) may have made this even better in my opinion.  Perhaps a slightly different crop, trying to gain more ''balance'', but again with the sky issues so who knows.  Nice overall ''feel'', like to see the ''rust'' even more vivid as well.  Possibly even a touch more ''darkness'' somewhere, especially given your (good and apt) title.  Up to 9 from 8.', '2005-12-06 23:55:05.000000', NULL, 1),
