(1929735, 263362, 17507, '<td valign="top">Ursula - of course! This photo could only be yours. I knew you wouldn''t disappoint in this challenge! Great processing - a wonderful effect and all the more interesting because I feel this is much darker than most of your imagery.</td>', 'Ursula - of course! This photo could only be yours. I knew you wouldn''t disappoint in this challenge! Great processing - a wonderful effect and all the more interesting because I feel this is much darker than most of your imagery.', '2005-12-07 00:21:43.000000', NULL, 0),
(1929736, 263110, 554, '<td valign="top">Thanks for the comments and the favorite tag.<br/>This was taken at Houston Texas Space Center where the displays are real fullsize items used by NASA.  This display was lighted by them and there was a black background above.  No flash and 1/15sec cam steadied on a building structure.  I really don''t understand the scores of 3 and below.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-12-07 00:25:44.</i></td>', 'Thanks for the comments and the favorite tag.This was taken at Houston Texas Space Center where the displays are real fullsize items used by NASA.  This display was lighted by them and there was a black background above.  No flash and 1/15sec cam steadied on a building structure.  I really don''t understand the scores of 3 and below.', '2005-12-07 00:21:52.000000', '2005-12-07 00:25:44.000000', 0),
