(1929806, 262251, 39349, '<td valign="top">Unbelievable!!!!!!!!!!!! 55 votes of 3 or under!?!?!?! I just don''t get it....<br/> <br/>Leroy, I don''t know if this will help but this shot IN NO WAY should be sitting 61st. I thought for sure that it would place much higher than it did. Shame that others didn''t find the beauty in this shot. Great idea and execution. Props to your model and you for, dare I say it? Thinking outside the box!</td>', 'Unbelievable!!!!!!!!!!!! 55 votes of 3 or under!?!?!?! I just don''t get it.... Leroy, I don''t know if this will help but this shot IN NO WAY should be sitting 61st. I thought for sure that it would place much higher than it did. Shame that others didn''t find the beauty in this shot. Great idea and execution. Props to your model and you for, dare I say it? Thinking outside the box!', '2005-12-07 00:40:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(1929807, 263244, 3214, '<td valign="top">whoo hoo Cristy, congrats on what I hope is the first of many ribbons!</td>', 'whoo hoo Cristy, congrats on what I hope is the first of many ribbons!', '2005-12-07 00:40:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(1929815, 263755, 25397, '<td valign="top">oh no sebi!!!!</td>', 'oh no sebi!!!!', '2005-12-07 00:42:26.000000', NULL, 0),
(1929843, 262251, 28742, '<td valign="top">Normally I am in favor of gratuitous nudity- wait, I mean normally I am NOT in favor of gratuitous nudity and I am not very willing to stretch very far to "see" someone''s vision of art. To me it either is or is not artistic - to me. Having said all that, I missed this one in the voting, but I would''ve given it an 8 or 9. I don''t see the nudity as gratuitous and I do see it as very artistic and if I thought about the "point" you were making, it would not be hard to get the contrast you pointed out. <br/> <br/>In summary, I think it was an awesome and unique shot! Very creative, artistic and great for the challenge. Has the wow factor and the out-of-the-box element everyone is always yammering about. <br/> <br/>Voters, eh, whaddya gonna do. Take pride in the shot, it is a masterpiece. And remember, that''s coming from a guy named "Art" ;-)<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-12-07 00:48:55.</i></td>', 'Normally I am in favor of gratuitous nudity- wait, I mean normally I am NOT in favor of gratuitous nudity and I am not very willing to stretch very far to "see" someone''s vision of art. To me it either is or is not artistic - to me. Having said all that, I missed this one in the voting, but I would''ve given it an 8 or 9. I don''t see the nudity as gratuitous and I do see it as very artistic and if I thought about the "point" you were making, it would not be hard to get the contrast you pointed out.  In summary, I think it was an awesome and unique shot! Very creative, artistic and great for the challenge. Has the wow factor and the out-of-the-box element everyone is always yammering about.  Voters, eh, whaddya gonna do. Take pride in the shot, it is a masterpiece. And remember, that''s coming from a guy named "Art" ;-)', '2005-12-07 00:47:46.000000', '2005-12-07 00:48:55.000000', 0),
(1929857, 262251, 11800, '<td valign="top">This is both classic and fresh. yumm, this is good. just fantastic.</td>', 'This is both classic and fresh. yumm, this is good. just fantastic.', '2005-12-07 00:49:58.000000', NULL, 0),
