(1929886, 263362, 48560, '<td valign="top">Ursula, great photo! This is one of the few in which I voted a full 10 :)</td>', 'Ursula, great photo! This is one of the few in which I voted a full 10 :)', '2005-12-07 00:59:03.000000', NULL, 0),
(1929896, 261958, 40019, '<td valign="top">I traveled that route MANY times at night between home in Chicago and Purdue University. The first thing I thought about was Gary, IN when this challenge was announced.  Glad you got the shot (and a top 10!).  Shame you missed the flames out of the smoke stacks though, it really is a sight to see.  Congrats!</td>', 'I traveled that route MANY times at night between home in Chicago and Purdue University. The first thing I thought about was Gary, IN when this challenge was announced.  Glad you got the shot (and a top 10!).  Shame you missed the flames out of the smoke stacks though, it really is a sight to see.  Congrats!', '2005-12-07 01:01:36.000000', NULL, 0),
(1929899, 263655, 31237, '<td valign="top">Artyom this is a great composition and a nice shot.</td>', 'Artyom this is a great composition and a nice shot.', '2005-12-07 01:02:23.000000', NULL, 0),
(1929905, 262251, 41370, '<td valign="top">I struggled with this one because I at first didn''t like the waxy look on the model but in the end I gave it a 10.  It was only one of three 10''s.  My scores are just average but I certainly can see a well done photograph.  I can''t believe this received 23 1''s.</td>', 'I struggled with this one because I at first didn''t like the waxy look on the model but in the end I gave it a 10.  It was only one of three 10''s.  My scores are just average but I certainly can see a well done photograph.  I can''t believe this received 23 1''s.', '2005-12-07 01:03:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(1929945, 262795, 12253, '<td valign="top">Holy smoke!  '')<br/> <br/>Congratulations!</td>', 'Holy smoke!  '') Congratulations!', '2005-12-07 01:15:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(1929958, 262251, 25232, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by corrie:</b></div><hr/><i> where is her safety gear,it only takes one spark to loose an eye.is the photo worth it </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>For the uninformed: It usually takes a chunk of hot metal to put out an eye. Sparks just hurt. I do think the addition of safty glasses would have added to the image.</td>', 'Originally posted by corrie: where is her safety gear,it only takes one spark to loose an eye.is the photo worth it   For the uninformed: It usually takes a chunk of hot metal to put out an eye. Sparks just hurt. I do think the addition of safty glasses would have added to the image.', '2005-12-07 01:20:20.000000', NULL, 0),
