(1930185, 261827, 5885, '<td valign="top">Listen, I''m not mad or anything, so here''s my take on it.<br/> <br/>I voted it a 5. Technically the exposure was good, but the focus seemed to be a bit soft. As far as composition goes, I found it too centered, especially since the bushes to the left throw off the centered look.<br/> <br/>But, aside from my vote, I believe that voters got over-exposed to shots of industrial plants. In both our case, it seems the box is either too full or too empty.</td>', 'Listen, I''m not mad or anything, so here''s my take on it. I voted it a 5. Technically the exposure was good, but the focus seemed to be a bit soft. As far as composition goes, I found it too centered, especially since the bushes to the left throw off the centered look. But, aside from my vote, I believe that voters got over-exposed to shots of industrial plants. In both our case, it seems the box is either too full or too empty.', '2005-12-07 02:22:08.000000', NULL, 0),
(1930215, 262984, 23458, '<td valign="top">This is pretty clearly the best photograph in the challenge. Having said that I''m not sure whether it actually fits the challenge - but I didn''t vote... so who cares. You get a hypothetical ten from me.</td>', 'This is pretty clearly the best photograph in the challenge. Having said that I''m not sure whether it actually fits the challenge - but I didn''t vote... so who cares. You get a hypothetical ten from me.', '2005-12-07 02:32:59.000000', NULL, 0),
