(1931101, 263362, 17203, '<td valign="top">Congrats on spreading your name all over the home page with another great shot! So Zoomdak has a beach, DrJOnes has a model and you have a... fertilizer plant? ;-)<br/> <br/>Since the crop you chose focuses so much on the sky, I probably would have picked a title like, "The Cloud Factory," but "Chocolate" obviously worked, and what could be more appealing than chocolate? I probably would have used a subtle inline on that dark border, too. I gotta find SOMETHING to criticize, right?<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-12-07 09:19:09.</i></td>', 'Congrats on spreading your name all over the home page with another great shot! So Zoomdak has a beach, DrJOnes has a model and you have a... fertilizer plant? ;-) Since the crop you chose focuses so much on the sky, I probably would have picked a title like, "The Cloud Factory," but "Chocolate" obviously worked, and what could be more appealing than chocolate? I probably would have used a subtle inline on that dark border, too. I gotta find SOMETHING to criticize, right?', '2005-12-07 09:18:50.000000', '2005-12-07 09:19:09.000000', 0),
