(1973818, 263732, 34659, '<td valign="top">Wow Scott - this is really good.  Very underrated IMHO.  It seems a tad busy at first, but it has great leading lines and the lighting is perfect (love the light rays).  Very industrial - certainly met the challenge well.  I wasn''t able to vote in this one, but would have easily scored an 8 from me.  Great perspective.</td>', 'Wow Scott - this is really good.  Very underrated IMHO.  It seems a tad busy at first, but it has great leading lines and the lighting is perfect (love the light rays).  Very industrial - certainly met the challenge well.  I wasn''t able to vote in this one, but would have easily scored an 8 from me.  Great perspective.', '2005-12-23 12:06:35.000000', NULL, 0),
