(5584832, 263110, 87808, '<td valign="top">well not a lot you can say about this really, once you have got past the wow factor it is all sort of plastic looking.  I think you could have done so much more with contrasts and shadows and highlights, even adding a tiny tiny bit of grain would have giving it some realistic feeling. I bet you could have blown peoples socks off with this if it had been advanved and could have dodged and burnt those back panels.</td>', 'well not a lot you can say about this really, once you have got past the wow factor it is all sort of plastic looking.  I think you could have done so much more with contrasts and shadows and highlights, even adding a tiny tiny bit of grain would have giving it some realistic feeling. I bet you could have blown peoples socks off with this if it had been advanved and could have dodged and burnt those back panels.', '2009-07-23 21:30:36.000000', NULL, 0),
