(6294789, 263715, 126969, '<td valign="top">I''ve tried shooting at this location &amp; it is difficult. I love how you''ve made colors, atmosphere and light the center of focus verses merely the stacks. Your eye travels to 3 points very nicely. The stacks, the gold whirl of trees to bottom right and back up to the swaying tree branch in the upper left. Very nice. Nice capture of the lights and their color. Winter is the best time to shoot the stacks as the white snow lights it nicely at night.</td>', 'I''ve tried shooting at this location & it is difficult. I love how you''ve made colors, atmosphere and light the center of focus verses merely the stacks. Your eye travels to 3 points very nicely. The stacks, the gold whirl of trees to bottom right and back up to the swaying tree branch in the upper left. Very nice. Nice capture of the lights and their color. Winter is the best time to shoot the stacks as the white snow lights it nicely at night.', '2011-01-26 10:40:30.000000', NULL, 0),
(6350771, 262251, 48954, '<td valign="top">i still think this is your best shot.</td>', 'i still think this is your best shot.', '2011-03-14 11:37:46.000000', NULL, 0),
